<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kombokela</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo chikijhandikwe na Mucha chikikemwa Kombokela</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kombokela</para>
  <para style="toc3">Komb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo chikijhandikwe na Mucha chikikemwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kombokela lya malaghalikilo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha Kombokela ndi mabhujhilo gha malaghalikilo ghighalongilwa kuhumii nkate jha itabo nhwano ya malaghalikilo yukutumbula ya lilaghano ya Makacho. Liina lya Kiebulaniya lya kitabo chenje lina mana jhenje, “Malobhe.” Inhobholeka kubhehe Mucha ndi jwakajhandike kitabo chenje nambo tu chehemo njokombe jhu kujhomolela jhichimulila kujhomwoka kwake. Kitabo chenje kitumbula kwa malobhe ghighalongela kubhehe, “Ghanga ndi malobhe gha Mucha kwa Akaichilahele.” Putulonge kubhehe Mucha ndi jwakajhandike kitabo chenje cha Kombokela ghilangii mala twe kuhumii mu Lilaghano liyono, nnandanikilo kuhumii mu kitabo cha Akatenga muchula jha 3:22-23, Petile palongila kuhumii mu kitabo cha Kombokela mu chehemo jha chula jha 18:15-18 nu kulonge kubhehe ghanga ndi ghakibha malobhe gha Mucha. Ihoto kubhehe Mucha ndi jwakajhandike kitabo chenje cha Kombokela pamonga na kitabo Chukutumbula na chu Kubhoka na kitabo cha Akalawe na kitabo cha Kibhalango, pange muchaka cha 1300 ade 1400, kabula jhukubhelukwa Yecho Kilichitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha Kombokela kijhandikwe ngita malaghano pakate jha munahota nkolongwa na unahota nkolongwa ghonge ghubhii pahe jha kindendeke chake ngita chitendika makacho. Ndi kujheketelana pakate jha Chapanga na bhando bhuku Ichilahele. Chapanga akajheketile kwape mota bhando anda bhene nabhakengama nu kujhokanikiya malaghalikilo ghake. Akaichilahele ngabhakana kukamula mihilo jha Chapanga ngibhachwapwile. Kilebhe chenio lya kukana kukengama nu kuchwapulwa ndi kilebhe kikolongwa mu kitabo chenje, nambo mu chula jha 27 na muchula jha 28, ichokolekeya uchakaka ghongo ilombona na mota yakanjika na likoto ngaipitii kuhumii mujhokanikilo amu kukana kujhokanikiya kwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Makabila ghange ghuku Ichilahele ghakajhemite mwitombe mwiye na mwiye, ngabhanonwiya malobhe gha mota yene na likoto lyenie, ngita ndela jhukulangii lilaghano bhalipokile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io1">Mucha ikombocha ghighapitila umwanja gwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele pibhakibha kunjenga, mu chula jha 1 ade 3.</para>
  <para style="io">Mucha ichimulila malaghalikilo gha lilaghano pakate jha Chapanga na bhando bhuku Ichilahele, mu chula jha 4 ade 26.</para>
  <para style="io">Bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhilonge mota na likoto kwa kunonoha lilobhe kulangii kubhehe lilaghano bhilipokile, mu chula jha 27 ade 30.</para>
  <para style="io">Mucha ilonge malobhe ghu kujhomolela kwa Yochuwa na kwa likabila lyake, kabula jhu kujhomwoka kwake, mu chula jha 31 ade 34.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Mucha alonge na Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Ghanga ndi malobhe ghalongila Mucha kwa bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele kipinde chibhakibha ku kingalennema upandi ghulipitii lyobha mwa Yoludane ghubhii ku Alaba, ghulolikihana na miche jha Sufu, pakate jha kilambo cha Palane na Tofeli na Labani na Hezilote na Dizahabo. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Kuhumii pikitombe Holebo ade Kadeshibameya kupete ndela jha kitombe chiku Seile mwanja gwa machiko kome na limo. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Lichiko likutumbula lya mwehe gwa kome na ghumo, chaka cha makome ncheche, kuhumii pamabhoka ku Michile, Mucha ngabhatangachila Akaichilahele ghalaghalikilwa na Bhambo Chapanga abhalobholele. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Atehila yene kubhoke kunhotola munahota nkolongwa Sihone jwa Akaamole jwalongwicha kubomane jha Heshibone, na kwenio ku Edilei nganhotwila Ogu munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Bashane jwalongwicha ku Ashitalote. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Mucha ngatumbwila kwalobholela bhando mihilo jha Chapanga kipinde pibhakibha kwiye ya lukemba Yoludane upandi ghulipitii lyobha ku kilambo chuku Moabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Ngalongila yene,<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Putukibha ku Holebu kukitombe chikikemwa Chinae, Bhambo Chapanga gwito ngatulobholila kubhehe, ‘Ntamingine kwa machiko ghamahele pikitombe chenje, <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />ngohe ntwekule ighono ino nnyendelele na mwanja. Nnyendengane ku kilambo chiku itombe ya Akaamole nu chehemo jha ilambo ya pahina ku Alaba, ku itombe na lulambo, ku Negebo na chehemo jha mbwane, ena, nnyendengane ade kilambo chiku Kanaane, nuku Lebanone, mpaka kulukemba lukolongwa lwa Efulate. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Nenga Bhambo Chapanga nakalongile kilambo chenje choha napekii akahoko bhino Ulaimo na Ichaka na Yakobu na ibheluko yabhe, nnyendengane makatole ibhaha jhino.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha ihaghuu ilongoche</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Kubhoka 18:13-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Mucha ngabhalobholila bhando kubhehe, “Putukibha kukitombe chuku Chinae, ne nikannobholile yene, ‘Nenga kanjikajhango kwalongocha mangota bhoha lihengo likolongwa hake. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, antehilingine nnyolokane kubhehe bhamahele, deleno mmi twe ngita ndondo yukunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhino, anyonjekeye mme twe mala pa elufo kupeta chimii ngohe nu kumpe mota ngita chalaghila! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Nambo kanjika ndo nanhoto bhole kuhenga lihengo lyenio litopaho likujhelenicha kukwapana kwino na mang'ahe ghino? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Nhwaghulane bhando kuhumii kila likabila bhina malango, umanye na bhina kutembekelwa na bhando, kupala nabheke bhabhe ilongoche bhino.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Mangota ngannyeketila, ngunyangwila, ‘Nhwalo ghunnongii gwamaha.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Yene, nganatola ilongoche bhina malango na bhina umanye na bhibhajhokanikiya, bheniya ndi bhimahagwila kuhumii mu makabila ghino, nganabheka kubhehe ilongoche bhino. Bhange bhakibha ilongoche ya likunde lya bhando elufoelufo, bhange bhakibha ilongoche ya likunde lya bhando miyamiya, bhange bhakibha ilongoche ya likunde lya bhando amchineamchine. Helahela bhange bhakibha ilongoche ya makabila.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Kipinde cheche nganapila mihilo akakenga bhino kulonge, ‘Nnyokanikiya mihalo jha bhando bhino. Nhwadabula chakaka chiipalwa paudamo pakate jha mundo na nnongomundo amu nng'ene jwaitama pamonga namangota. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Mangannoleke jhe mundo kumiho pimihadabula, majhokanikiya bhoha changajheghemeke kumo, akanahota amu yana. Manga nyoghopa jhe mundo jhojhoha, nhwalo luhadabulo ndi lwa Chapanga. Andaubhii nhwalo unonopaho hake kwino, unetela ne nanyokanikiya.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Kipinde chela, nganinnaghalikiya ilebhe yoha ipalwa kuhenga.”<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akalingukii bhitenda kutumwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Kibhalango 13:1-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Ngatutehila ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito chatulaghalikiye. Ngatutumbwila mwanja kubhoka ku Holebo ku itombe ya Chinae, ngutupete kunjenga ngolongwa jhijhoghoha lela limuliwene, kukupete ndela jhu kujhenda ku kilambo chitombe ya Akaamole. Yene ngatuhikita Kadeshi Beneya. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Peniya, nganninobholila kubhehe, ‘Ngohe nhwikite kukilambo chi itombe ya bhando bhuku Amole, jhatupii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Dola, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino akibhekite kilambo nnonge jhino, ajha nnyendengane, makatole ibhaha jhino, ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahokobhino chibhalobholila. Mangajhoghopa jhe hilu kuhengeleka mwojho.’<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Nambo mangota mabhando bhoha ngunhikila, nu kulonge, ‘Twalongoleye bhando nnonge jhito, kupala bhakalingukiye kilambo nu kutulangii ndela jhitupala kupeta, na miche jhitupala kuijhendela kwenio.’<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Kilebhe chenie nganikibhona chamaha hake, yenie nganahagwila bhando kome nabhabhele, mundo jhumo kila likabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Bhando bheniya ngabhajhenda kuilambo yiitombe, ngabhaika pululambo lwa Eshikole, nukulingukiya chehemo jhenio. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Pibhabhujhita, ngabhatugheghila uhohe ghukulye kuhumii kilambo chenie na ngabhatulobholila kubhehe kilambo chenie chatupela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, kilambo chikibholii hake.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Nambo mangotamwe mukajhokanikii jhe mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kukana kujhenda ku kilambo chenio. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Ngankokolikiya mu mahema ghino, kulonge, Bhambo Chapanga itenda kutuchimwa, yene atubhoite ku kilambo chuku Michile, na kutuleka mumabhoko gha Akaamole bhatukome. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Nhwalo ghani tujhenda kwenio? Tutenda kujhoghopa. Bhando bhitatumita kwenio bhatulobholii naha, bhando bha kwenio ni akatandamaho hake na bhina makakala kutupeta twenga, na bhitama mu miche itindikilwe mapamanda matandamaho ade kulihunde. Kabhele bhalongii kubhehe bhabhwene bhando bhakolonga bha ibheluko ya Akaanake.<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Nambo nenga nganongila kubhehe, ‘Mangajhoghopa jhe bhando bheniya. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jwannongolela, ndi nankomanila ngita hela channolita chankomanila pankombwila kubhoke ku Michile, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />nu kunjenga. Ngannolita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chabhagheghita kwa mwanja gwino ghoha kila chehemo ngita tate chaghegha mwanamundo ade kuika pamba.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Pamonga nukwalobholela gheniya ghoha, mangota mukanhobholijhe Bhambo Chapanga gwino, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />jwenie ndi jwannongwicha mundela, nukumpalikiya chehemo pukubheka kighono. Kilo ngannongwiya ku luheke lwa mwotu na muhe kulihunde kupala kumulikila ndela jhimijhendela.”<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhambo Chapanga abhachwapu Akaichilahele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 14:20-40">Kibhalango 14:20-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Bhambo Chapanga ngajhoa kukokoleka kwino nganchimwa, ngalapila kulonge, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Abhii jhe mundo hilu jhumo pakate jha kibheluko chenje kibhoho jwapakukibhona kilambo chikibholile chela chanalaghi kwape akahoko bhino. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Kalebo mwana jwa Yefune ndo jwapakujhingii kwenio. Nane mbakumpe kilambo chenie chajhawila kulingukii kibhehe chake jwenio pamonga na ibheluko yake kwa nhwalo jhukuhobholeka hake kwango.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Nhwalo gwino mangota Bhambo Chapanga nganjimwa na nenga hele, ngalongila, ‘Hilu mwenga ma Mucha mijhingii jhe mu kilambo chenie. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nambo Yochuwa mwana jwa Nune ndi ntangatila jwino, naika kwenio. Kwa yene munkwimicha mwojho nhwalo jwenie ndi jwapa kwalongoya bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhakatame kilambo chenie kibhehe chabhe.’<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngatulobholila twe twabhoha kubhehe, ‘Yana ino imipwelela kubhehe nabhakamulwa nu kutolwa kwa makakala na akamakoko bhino, nhwalo yana yenie yanamanya jhe mabhoho na ghambone, bheniya ndi bhibhapa kujhingii mu kilambo chenio, nane naniipela kilambo chenie nabhene nabhakitenda kibhehe chabhe. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Nambo mangotamwe, nng'alambuke na nkelebhuke nnyende ndela jhi kunjenga upande gwa Mbwane jha Chamo.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Peniya, ngunyangwila kubhehe, ‘Twenga tutehi malemwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngohe natukomana ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito chatulaghalikiya.’ Yene, kila mundo ngakilenganikiya tela kukomana ngondo, kongo nhwachilangana kubhehe nakibhaha kilebhe kijhojhoho kukibula kilambo chenie cha itombe.”<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga nganobholila nenga, “Makanakiya bhando bheniya bhanga jhenda jhe kukomana nhwalo mijhe pamo na bheniya, bhakoto kujhenda nabhachwapulwa na akamakoko bhabhe. <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Yene ne nganinnobholila gheniya, mangota machikilo majhomo. Nambo ngankana kukengama lilaghalikilo lya Bhambo Chapanga, na kindume chino ngamujhawila kukilambo chi itombe kukomana. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Peniya, Akaamole bhibhakibha bhatamita kilambo chenie chi itombe ngibhahelila ngita njuche, na ngabhambulita kuhumii ku Cheile ade ku Olima. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Yene, ngankelewika, ngamunelila Bhambo Chapanga, nambo Bhambo Chapanga akannyokanikii jhe hilu kunnyali.”<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaka yibhakibha kunjenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Bhahe, ngantama kwenio ku Kadeshi kwa machiko ghamahele, kipinde choha ngantamita kwenio.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Peniya, ngatughalambwika, ngatujhenda kunjenga kupete ndela jha Mbwane jha Chamo, ngita Bhambo Chapanga chatulaghila, ngatutindilatindila ku kilambo chi itombe yuku Cheile kwa machiko ghamahele.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga nganobholila, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />Ntinditindii hake mu kilambo chi itombe chenio, ngohe nng'alambuke nnyende upande gwa kachikachine. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Malobholela bhando nhwilo ghongo, mmandikii kupete ku kilambo chi itombe ya Cheile, kilambo cha akalongo bhino, ibheluko ya Echau. Bheniya nabhannyoghopa, nambo mma miho, <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />mangakomana nabho jhe nhwalo nimpengana jhe hilu pandina chehemo jha kilambo chabhe. Kilambo chenie chi itombe ya Cheile nimpile Echau ibheluko yake ibhehe jhabhe. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Anda mipala chakulyegha amu mache kubhoka kwabhe, chakaka ntenda kuhemela kwa madine gha chaba.”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Bhahe nkomboke Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino pampelengine mota mu kila kilebhe chanteilingine. Ngantunjita pimakibha mukutindilatindila mu njenga jhenje ngolongwa. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino abhii pamonga na mangota kwa yaka henge makome ncheche na mangota mpongokiwe jhe kilebhe chochoha.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Yene, ngatujhendilila na mwanja gwito, ngatwapetita akalongo bhito, ibheluko ya Echau yenie yatama ku Cheile, ngatuilekite ndela jhuku jhenda ku Alaba na ilambo yuku Elate nuku Esione Gebele. Peniya ngatughalambuka kukengama ndela jhukupete njenga jhuku Moabo. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga nganobholila, ‘Mangachumbu jhe bhando bhuku Moabo hilu kukomana nabho ngondo, nhwalo nimpeke jhe mangota hilu pandina chehemo mu kilambo chabhe. Nhwalo kilambo chenie kikemitwa Ari, naapekii ibheluko ya Luto kibhehe chino.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />“Makacho kilambo chenie chuku Ari bhatamita bhando twe, bhina makakala bhibhakemitwa Akaemi na bhakibha akatandamaho ngita Akaanake. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Ngita hela Akaanake, bhando bheniya bhamanyikina ngita Akalefai, nambo Akamoabo bhakemita Akaemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Na Akaole makacho bhatamita kwenio ku Cheile, nambo ibheluko ya Echau ngabhabhenga na kwakoma pulutu, peniya ngabhatama bhene chehemo jhenio, ngita Akaichilahele ngabhatehila helenaha kukilambo chabhapila Bhambo Chapanga kibhehe chabhe.”<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngatulobholila, “ ‘Ngohe mmokengane, nnyomboke kakipela Zelede.’ Bhahe ngatujhombwika kakipela keniya. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Ngaipeta yaka makome matato na nane kubhoke putubhoka ku Kadeshe Baneya ade kujhomboka lulambo lwa ku Zelede. Kipinde chenie, kibheluko choha cha bhando bheniya ndanga jhukuhoto kujhenda kungondo kikibha kijhomwike ngita palongila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Jwenie Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendelela kwabula kupala kwakoma pulutu kwenio kukighono, ata bhoha ngabhajhomwika.”<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Bhahe, bhando bhoha bhina ndanga jhukujhenda kungondo pibhatabhuka nnema, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kubhehe, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Deleno namujhomboka mpaka gwa Moabo kupete kilambo chikikemitwa Ari. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Nanhwikila kukilambo chuku Amone. Mangachumbu jhe hilu kukomana nabho kwa nhwalo nimpee jhe chehemo jhojhoha jha kilambo cha ibheluko ya Akaamole, ibhehe jhino. Bheniya ndi ibheluko ya Loti, nimpelingine kilambo chenie kibhehe chabhe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Helahela kilambo chenie kimanyikina kubhehe ndi kilambo cha Akalefai. Nambo Akaamone bhakemita bhando bheniya Akazamuzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Bheniya Akalefae bhakibha bhakajholokine hake, kabhele bhando bhina makakala na akatandamaho ngita Akaanake. Bhambo Chapanga ngabhajhomwila pulutu palonge jha Akaamole, kupala Akaamole bhatame mwenio. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngateila hele kwa Akaedomu bhibhakibha ibheluko ya Echau, bhibhatamita kuilambo ya itombe ya Edomu. Bhambo Chapanga ngabhakomita Akahole kupala Akaedomu bhatole kilambo chenio nuku tama, na bhitama mukilambo chenio ade ngohe. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Peniya makacho Akaave bhibhatamita mu chenda jha muupele jha mbwane jha Meditelaniya ade muche gwa ku Gacha. Badae ngabhahikita Akafitole kuhuma kulindala lya Kafitole jhiikemwa Kilete ngabhakomelekeya, ngabhatama mwenio badala jhabhe.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Patujhombwika lukemba lwa Moabo, “Bhambo Chapanga ngatulaghila kulonge, ‘Ajha! Nnyimwike ntumbuu mwanja. Nnyomboke lukemba lwa Alinone. Nenga nanintenda munhotole munahota nkolongwa Sihone muamole, jwatama ku Eshibone na muche gwake. Mumpukile nu kutumbuu kutama mu muche gwake. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Kutumbulii ngohe nu kujhendelela mbakwatenda bhando bhoha pannema bhabhe na kiholo nu kunnyoghopa mangota. Pibhapakujhoha mihalo jhino mangota nabhalendima nukujhoghopa.’”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhinhoto munahota nkolongwa Sihone</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Kibhalango 21:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Nganatuma bhando kuhumii kunjenga jha Kedemote bhajhende ku munahota Sihone jwa Eshibone bhahikiche malobhe gha uteeke, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />Utujheketele kupeta mu kilambo chino. Tupeta mundela tugha nu kujhenda chomola changalyungalyunga kwalelo amu kwangejha. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Twenga natuhemela chukulye pamonga na mache ghitupa kunywegha chitupala kwino utujheketela tupete tu mu kilambo chino, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />tujhomboke lukemba lwa Yoludane tujhingii kilambo chatupii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito twenga. Helahela ibheluko ya Echau bhibhatama kwenio ku Cheile na Akamoabo bhibhatama ku Ari, ngatujheketila hele tupeta mu ilambo yabhe.”<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Nambo Sihone, munahota nkolongwa jwa Eshibone, ngatukanila kupeta mu kilambo chake. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngantenda abhe muto nnyomo na ngandango, kupala tunhotole nu kutola kilambo chake chitutama ade ngohe.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga nganobholila, dola nitumbwile kuntenamekite munahota nkolongwa Sihone na kilambo chake mu kindendeke chino, ntole kilambo chake kibhehe chino. <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Yene, Sihone ngabhoka na bhando bhake bhoha kukomana natwenga pahina na muche gwaku Yahasa. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, ngantenda tunhotole, na ngatunkoma jwene na yana mundo na bhando bhake bhoha. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Ngatutola kwa makakala muche gwake nu kukihangabhana, ngatwakoma akanalome na akakeghe na yana, tunnekite jhe mundo ghome ata jhumo. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Ngatutola ipugho na ilebhe yoha yambone ituikolila mwenio. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Kutumbuu Aloele, muche chikibhii muupele jhu lulambo lwa Alinone na muche chikibhii mu lulambo lwenio ade ku Gileade, ukibha jhe muche ghoghoha ghukibha na makakala ghukukomana na twenga. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito ngaibhekita miche yoha mu mabhoko ghito. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nambo tubhandikii jhe kilambo cha Akaamole amu ilambo ibhii muupele jhu lukemba Yaboke, amu chehemo jhojhoha jha itombe jhatukanikiye Bhambo Chapanga gwito.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhinhoto munahota nkolongwa Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Kibhalango 21:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Peniya, ngatughalambwika kujhenda ku Bashane, munahota nkolongwa Ogu, ngaikita na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha kukomana ngondo natwenga pahina na muche ghuku Edulei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga nganobholila kubhehe, ‘Mangannyoghopa jhe, nhwalo namunhotola kumbula na kilambo chake choha. Chamtenda ngita chimintendila Sihone, munahota nkolongwa jwa Akaamole jwalongwicha kukilambo chiku Heshibone.’<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Yene, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito ngammekita Ogu munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Bashane pamonga na akakomana ngondo bhake bhoha, ngatwakomalikiya, akahighilike jhe ata jhumo. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Ngatutola miche jhake jhoha, ubhii jhe hilu ghumo ghutulekite. Miche jhenie jhoha jhituipukile ikibha makome chita, miche jhenie jhoha ikibha muchehemo jha Alugobo jhilongwichwa na Ogu, munahota nkolongwa jwaku Bashane. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Miche jhoha ikatindikilwe mapamanda matandamalo, ghighakibha na matangala ghighadinditwa na mikolokote. Helahela pakibha na chenda mbwe yangatindikilwa na mapamanda. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Yene, ngatuhangabhina kila kilebhe kwenio, ngatutilulina miche na kwakoma akanalome na akakeghe na yana pyepye, ngita chituteila kwa Sihone, munahota nkolongwa jwaku Heshibone. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Nambo ipugho na ilebhe itupukila kungondo ngatutoila.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Kipinde chenie ngatutoila ilambo kuhumii kwa bheniya akanahaota bhabhele bha Akaamole upande ghulihumii lyobha kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane ade pakate jha kipela cha Alunone na itombe ya Helumone. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Akachidone bhuukema kitombe chenie cha Helumone Sirione, na Akaamole bhuukema kitombe chenie Senile. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Ngatutoila miche yoha yumundika na chehemo jhoha jha Gileade na Bashane ade ku Saleka nuku Edulai, miche ya munahota nkolongwa Ogu, kwenio ku Bashane.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Munahota nkolongwa Ogu, kanjika ndi jwakahighalike pakate jha Akalefai. Kindanda chake kikatenganichwe kwa choma, kikibha nuutandamaho gwa fute kome nuubhele na ukendaho gwake fute chita, kwa ipemo yituyobhalile. Kindanda chenio kibhii ku muche gwa Akaamole mwa Laba.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila ghighatamita upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa Yoludane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Kibhalango 32:1-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Pututoila kilambo chenie, nganapila likabila lya Leubene na Gade chehemo jhukutumbulii kachikachine mwa muche gwa Aroele pahina na Alunone na nucho jha chehemo jha itombe ya Gileade, pamonga na miche jhake. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Chehemo jhihighalike jha Gileade pamonga na Bashane jhoha jhilongwichwa na Ogu, chenio ndi kilambo chikikemitwa Alugobu, nganapila likabila lya Manache. Kipinde chenie Bashane imanyikina ngita kilambo cha Akalefai.”<verse eid="DEU 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yailu, mundo jwa likabila lya Manache, ngatola kilambo choha cha Alugobo, yane Bashane ade kumpa gwa Geshule na Maaka. Chenda yoha yenie ngaikema liina lyake Hawote Yailu.<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Bhando bhulukolo lwa Makile bha likabila lya Manache nganapila ku Gileade, <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />na likabila lya Leubene nganapila kuhumii Gileade ade lukemba Alunone. Mpaka gwabhe kwa upande gwa kuchine ukibha lukemba na upande gwa kachikachine ukibha lukemba Yaboke ndi ghupakana na kilambo cha Akaamole. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Upande ghulitipikii lyobha kilambo chabhe kikajhenii ade lukemba Yoludane, kuhumii lilabha lya Galilaya upande gwa kachikachine, kikahelelii ade mbwane jha Alaba, yane Mbwane jha Mwinyo, ade mihelelo jha Pisiga kwa upande ghulihumii lyobha.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Kipinde chela nganapeila malaghalikilo ghanga, ‘Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ampekii kilambo chenje kulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane kibhehe kilambo chino. Ngohe mangotamwe mmanganganga pakate jha akalongo bhino, ntolangane chilaha nnyomboke lukemba Yoludane kongo mmii nnonge jha akalongo bhino Akaichilahele. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Nambo akaanabhino na yana ino na ipugho ino naighalika mu chenda inimpilingine. Manye mmii na ipugho twe hake. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Matangatile akalongo bhino Akaichilahele ade Bhambo Chapanga papakutenda bhapomole chehemo jhabhe ngita chummii mangota, bhene helahela nabhabha na kilambo chabhe, Bhambo Chapanga nabhapela kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane. Pighapakupeta gheniya, mihoto kukelebhuka mu kilambo chino chinimpelingine kibhehe chino!’<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Peniya, nganinnobholila Yochuwa, ‘Mwe nnolite kwa miho ghino mabhene, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ilebhe yabhatendii akanahota akakolongwa bhabhele bhano, Sihone na Ogu, jwenie nantendela helenaha akanahota bhoha mu ilambo impakupeta. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Mangapwelela jhe bheniya nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nabhakomanila mangota.’<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha ikanilwa kujhingi ku Kaanane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Kipinde chenio nganinyopita Chapanga kulonge, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Mwe Bhambo Chapanga, manye unangii ne nantumiche gwino utumbulo tu gwa ukolo na uhotolo gwino. Nhwalo abhii chapanga jhonge kwenio kunane amu pannema jwahoto kutenda ilebhe ikolongwa na ya kukangacha ngita chuteii mwenga? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Chonde ninnyopa nyomboke kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane, nakalole kilambo china kuhalala upande ghulitipikii lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane, ena kilambo kihalanaho cha itombe pamonga na itombe yuku Lebanone.’<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngayomila kwa nhwalo gwino mangota, ngakanita kunyokanikiya. Nganobholila kubhehe, ‘Ikwela! Mangalonge jhe kabhele nhwalo gwenio. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Nkwela ade kukilegheleghe cha kitombe Pisiga, makalolekehe maha upandi ghulitipikii lyobha na kachikachine na kuchine na upandi ghulihumii lyobha, nukukilola kilambo chenio, nambo mwenga mijhomboka ng'o lukemba Yoludane. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Nambo mpela Yochuwa malaghalikilo, nkwimicha mwojho nu kunkangamalicha, nhwalo jwenio ndi jwapakwalongocha bhando bhamba ade kwiye, kukitola kilambo chipa kukibhona.’<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Yene, ngatutamita mu lulambo lwa lukemba Yoludane nnonge jha Bete Peole.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Mucha abhalaghii Akaichilahele bhintembekeya mihilo jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Mucha ngajhendilila kulonge, “Ngohe nnyokanikiya nu kukamu malaghalikilo ghoha na mihilo jhinimmolingine, kupala mukatame nu kutola kilambo chela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhino, jhampelangana. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Mangajhonjeke jhe chochoha mu mihilo jhinimpelangana, hilu mangapongocha jhe kilebhe chochoha, nambo mitembekeya mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhinimpelengana. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mangota kwa miho ghino mukaiwene ilebhe yatendita Bhambo Chapanga kwa kichapanga Baal Peole. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ngabhajhomwila bhando bhoha pulutu pakate jhino bhibhannyinamila Baale peole. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Nambo mangotamwe mukahobholike kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ndi nhwalo mmi ghome ade deleno.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Ajha! Nimmolingine mihilo na malaghalikilo ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chanaghalikiya, kupala mitembekee mu kilambo chimijhenda kutola ibhehe jhino. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Mikamula na kulenganikiya mihilo na malaghalikilo gheniya na anda nteingine gheniya bhando bhi ilambo henge nabhamanya mihilo jhenejhe, nabhamanya kubhehe mangota mmi kumanya na malango, bhilonge, ‘Chakaka bhando bhi kilambo chenje kikolongwa bhakwete malango nu umanye.’”<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Kibhii jhe kilambo chochoha ata chapanga gwabhe abhehe nkolongwa ngita nike na abhii pahina nabheniya na pibhannyopa ihoto kwajhangula ngita hela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito chatujhanguu pitunnyopa. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Wala bhabhijhe bhando bhikilambo jhojhoha jhenge ata ikabhehe kikolongwa bhole, bhina mihilo na malaghalikilo gha mbone ghighapalwa kukengamwa ngita ghanga ghanimmolingine deleno. <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />“Nambo mma miho nukukilonda hake hilu mangalibhilila jhe umwojho gwino ilebhe hela yimibhoningina kwa miho ghino mabhene machiko ghoha gha ughome gwino. Mabholangana yana ino na ichokolo ino, <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />nhwalo gwa lichiko lela lyamujhemita nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kukitombe chuku Holebo, panobholila, ‘Makonganiche bhando bheniya nnonge jhango, nalobholele malobhe ghango kupala bhikibhole kunyoha nenga machiko ghoha muughome gwabhe, na kwabhola yana yabhe kuhenga gheniya.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Bhahe, maalobholela yana ino, ngunhweghelila nu kujhema nhwina jha kitombe chenio kipinde chenie kikibha kikajhaka mwotu ghuika kunane kwa Chapanga na kitombe chenie kikibha kiyekelilwe lubhendo tyoo na lihunde litopaho. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngalongela na mangotamwe kuhumii panakate jha mwotu gwenio, ngamujhoha malobhe ghalongila, nambo makamwejhe chamile, ngamulijhoina lilobhe lyake tu. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Jwenie ngantangachila lilaghano lyake ngannaghila mwikamula mihilo kome ijhandikwe panane jhi ibao ibhele ya maghanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Kipinde chenie Bhambo Chapanga ngannaghila nimmolangane mihilo na malaghalikilo ghoha ghighapalwa kghalenganikiya mu kilambo chimijhenda kutola kubhehe chino.”<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lupwato nhwalo ghu kujhinamila inyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Bhambo Chapanga palongela namangota kwako kukitombe ku Holebo panakate jha mwotu makamwe jhe ngita chabhile. Kwa nhwalo gwenio mma miho hake, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />mangatenda jhe uhakao kukukibhachi mabhene inyagho, inyagho ilandana na munalome amu mwikeghe <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />amu kinyama amu kijhune, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />amu kulandanikiya na kinyama chikikwabha pannema amu homba jhumumache. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Mma miho, kupala pimpakulola kunane nu kulibhona lyobha amu mwehe amu ndondo na ilebhe yoha yukunane mangahutilwa jhe kuijhinamila na kuitumikila. Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino aipangina nhwalo jha bhando bhoha pannema. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Nambo mangota ndi bhando bhakombwile kuhumii ku Michile mu litanule lya mwotu lya choma. Ammohita kupala mme mabhando bhake ngita chimmii ngohe. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Ku nhwalo gwino Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngayomila, ngalapila kubhehe ne nanyomboka jhe lukemba Yoludane kujhingii kukilambo chela chambone chikibholile chammpelangana kibhehe chino. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nenga nanyomokela mu kilambo chenje, nanyomboka jhe lukemba, nambo mangota mmandikii kujhomboka kujhenda kilambo chela chambone chikibholile. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mma miho mangalibhilila jhe lilaghano lyatei Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, pamonga, mitendekeya mihilo jhake na mangakibhachii jhe kinyagho chochoha chukubhacha, chakanakii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kunnandanikiya, <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ndi mwotu lipela ghujhomola, na jwenio ndi Bhambo Chapanga jhuna wiho.”<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Pimpa kutama mu kilambo chenie, andampapite yana na ichokolo na mangota kughoima, mangalemwa jhe nu kukitendeke kinyagho chikilebhe chochoha, chenie nakibhaha ubhoho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na muntenda achimwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Bhahe, ne deleno niikema kunane kwa chapanga na nnema ibhaha chaide pakate jhino, ninnobholela kubhehe mala jhimo nunkomelekelwa pulutu kukilambo chimijhenda kutola kubhehe chino kwenio kwiye jhu lukemba Yoludane. Mitama jhe machiko twe kwenio, nambo nannyomokangana pulutu. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Bhambo Chapanga nantenda mpechengane pakate jhi ilambo henge, nabhaighala bhandina tugha kwenio. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Kwenio namutumikila ichapanga yiitenganichwe kwa mikongo na maghanga ghighatenganichwe na bhando, na jhangahoto kulola nu kujhoha jhe nu kulye jhe hilu kunuya jhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Peniya kuhumii momo mwenio mukilambo namumpalaha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, na mangota mwe namumpata anda namumpalaha kwa mwojho gwino gwoha nukwa uhuke gwino gwoha. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Ilebhe yenio yoha ipakunkolela kwenio nu kummeka kulagha, peniya ndi pimipakumujhila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kunnyokanikiya. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ndi Chapanga jhuna kiya, inneka jhe hilu inkoma jhe mangota, hilu kulibhalila lilaghano lyatei na akahoko bhino.”<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Nhwachila hake ghighapitile makacho, kipinde mangota nukubhelukwa jhe, kuhumii lichiko lela Chapanga papangina mundo pannema. Nkonyekeya kunane kwa Chapanga na pannema poha anda nhwalo gwenio nkolongwa uwaite kupitila amu kujhokanikika! <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Bho, abhii mundo jwawaite kujhoha lilobhe lya Chapanga likapitila panakate jha mwotu na kujhendelela kulama ngita chinyohingine mangota? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Amu abhii Chapanga jhojhoha jwajhighite kujhenda kwatola bhando bhake kilambo chenge? Nambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chantelengine pimikibha ku Michile, kukunyigha na nginyililo na ikangacho amu kwa ngondo na kwa makakala ghake makolongwa, ngatenda ilebhe ikujhoghoha na mangota ngannolita kola ku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Nambo mangota annangiye ghanga kupala nhoto kumanya, Bhambo Chapanga kanjika ndo ndi Chapanga abhii jhe jhonge. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Chapanga ngantenda mangota nnyohe lilobhe lyake kuhumii kunane kupala ammole kunnyokanikiya jwene. Na pannema pano ngantenda mubhone mwotu gwake nkolongwa nu kujhoha malobhe ghake kuhumii pamwotu gwenio. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akatei kwapala akahoko bhino, ndi nganhaghula mangota bhumii ibheluko hino nu kummoha kukilambo chuku Michile kwa makakala ghake makolongwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Chapanga ngabhabhenga bhando bhina makakala hake mu ilambo yabhe nnonge jhino, kupala ampelangane mangota kilambo chahe kibhe kilambo chino. Ngita chibhii deleno! <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Yene deleno mangota nkomboka nu kubheka umwojho gwino kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ndi Chapanga jwa kunane na pahe pannema na abhii jhe Chapanga jhonge. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Kuyene mikamula mihilo na malaghalikilo ghake ghinimpelangana deleno, kupala ilebhe ino inyendela telatela mangota pamonga na ibheluko ino nu kulama machiko ghamahele pikilambo champelangana Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kibhe chino machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miche yukutilila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />“Peniya, Mucha ngabheka miche mitato upande ghulihumii lyobha mwa lukemba Yoludane, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />miche jhenie mundo ahoto kutilila nukughombo ughome gwake, anda akomite mundo jwangabhe likoko lyake amu changanamiye mundo jwenio ahoto kutilila kukilambo chimo pakate jhi miche jhenie nakomwa jhe. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Miche jhenie ndi Basele muche gwanga itombe, nhwalo jha likabila lya Leubene nu ku Lamose ku kilambo cha Akagileade, kwa nhwalo jha likabila lya Akagade nuku Golane kukilambo chuku Bashane kwa nhwalo jha likabila lya Akamanache.”<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha ilonge kabhele malaghalikilo gha Chapanga kukubweleya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Mucha ngabhapila Akaichilahele malaghalikilo na mabholo gha Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ghanga ndi malaghalikilo na mihilo na adabulo Mucha jhapangita Akaichilahele kipinde pibhabhokita kukilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />Kipinde pibhakibha kwiye jhu lukemba Yoludane piling'engo lilibhii pahina na Bete Peole, kukilambo chichikibha chu munahota nkolongwa Sihone jwa Akaamole jwalongwicha ku Eshibone, jwenio Mucha na bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngubhanhotwila kumbula pibhabhokita ku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Helahela Akaichilahele ngabhatola kwa makakala, kilambo cha munahota nkolongwa Ogu jhuku Bashane. Akanahota bhabhele bheniya bha Akaamole kwenio kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane, upandi ghulihumii lyobha. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Ku yene Akaichilahele ngibhikinhotwila kilambo choha kuhumii ku Aloele muupele jhu lukemba Alinone ade kitombe chuku Silihone, hele kikemitwa kitombe Helumone, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />pamonga na chehemo jhoha upande ghulihumii lyobha jhu lukemba Yoludane ade kumbwane jha Mwinyo, kupehekelo chu mihelelo jha itombe ya Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo kome</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Kubhoka 20:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Mucha ngabhakemita pamonga Akaichilahele bhoha na kwalobholela, “Mangota Makaichilahele mijhokanikiya mihilo na malaghalikilo ghinilonge deleno nnonge jhino. Mikibhole gheniya nukughahenge lihengo ngita chiipalwa. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngatenda lilaghano pamonga natwenga kukitombe cha Holebo, liina lenge kikemwa Chinae. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Bhambo Chapanga kabhekite jhe lilaghano lyenie na ighogholo bhito tu jhe nambo ngabheka pamonga natwenga hele tutubhii ghome pamba deleno. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila na mangota miho kwa miho kwenio kukitombe panakate jha mwotu. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Kipinde chenie nenga nakajhemite pakate jhino mangota na Bhambo Chapanga, nganintangachila malobhe ghalongila Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo mangota mujhoghopa mwotu na makahobhwike jhe pikitombe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila naha, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Nenga ndi Nabhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhunimmohita ku Michile kwamakibha makabhanda.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“Mangajhinamii jhe ichapanga henge nambo ne tugha.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“Mangatendekeyajhe inyagho jha ichapanga yukubhacha kunhwalo gwa Chapanga, hilu jhukulandanikiya nikilebhe chochoha chikibhii kunane kwa Chapanga, amu chikibhii pahe pannema amu chikibhii umache pahe jha nnema. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Mangajhinami jhe hilu kuitumikila, nhwalo nenga ndi Nabhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, Chapanga jhumii nulupemelo. Kwahadabuu yana kwa malemwa gha ibheluko bhabhe, kutumbulii kibheluko chatato na cha ncheche na bhoha bhibhangana. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Nambo nalangi upalo gwango bhando maelufo bhibhambala nu kukamuu malaghalikilo ghango.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“Mingililonge jhajhe jhe liina lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nhwalo ne Nabhambo Chapanga naninneke jhe mundo kunhadabula jwaitenda yenie.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“Muikamula Lichiko li Kupomolela nikukibheka kubhehe nyahinyahi ngita chininaghila Nenga Nabhambo Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Machiko chita nhwenga mahengo ghino ghoha nu nhwenga mihalo jhino jhoha, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />nambo lichiko lya chaba ndi Lichiko li Kupomolela, lyenie libhekwitwe kwa nhwalo gwango. Lichiko lyenie mangota mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha hilu mwana gwino munalome amu mwana gwino mwikeghe, amu ng'ombi jwino amu liponda lino amu kinyama chino chochoha na nng'ene jwabhii pakajhino na mangota, kupala mmanda gwino munalome nu mwikeghe bhapomolela hele ngita pimipomolela mwenga. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Mangajhewa jhe kubhehe namangota mukibha makabhanda hele ku kilambo chuku Michile, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngammohita kwenio kwa makakala ghulubhoko na lubhoko luluhandambwile, ndi nhwalo ninhwamulicha kulikamula Lichiko li Kupomolela.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“Maichimu tategwino na majhegwino ngita Nabhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chanaghalikiya, ntenda yene kupala nname machiko ndiii ni ilebhe ino inyendela telatela pikilambo chammpela Bhambo Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“Mangakoma jhe.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“Mangatenda jhe ngongola.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“Mangajhibha jhe.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“Mangapiya jhe uchaide ghuwange kwa nnyino.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“Mangannoghe jhe nhwana gwa nnyino hilu mangahuti jhe nyumba jhake amu nng'onda gwake amu mmanda gwake munalome amu mwikeghe hilu ng'ombe jwake amu liponda lyake hilu kilebhe chochoha chakwete.<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Ghanga ndi malaghalikilo ghannobholila Bhambo Chapanga kulilobhe likolongwa kuhumii pamwatu na pilihunde tyoo, nu lubhendo tyoo kipinde chimikibha nkonganike pikitombe hilu ibhii jhe mihilo jhenge. Kuhumii peniya ngajhandika mwiibao ibhele ya maghanga, ngambila.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujhoghopa kwa bhando</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kubhoka 20:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Kipinde kitombe choha pikijhakita mwotu na pimijhohina lilobhe kuhumii pulubhendo, ilongoche bhino na akanahota bhino bha makabila ngibhanhikilila, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />nu kulonge, ‘Nnola! Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito atulaite twenga ung'alicho na makakala gwake nkolongwa putujhohina akalongela kuhumii pamwotu! Deleno nnolite kubhehe Chapanga ulonge na bhando bhakawi jhe nambo ngabhajhendelela kubhehe ghome. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Nambo ngohe kunike tupala kuwegha? Nhwalo mwotu ogho nkolongwa upakutukoma, anda tujhohine kabhele lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito tupakuwe. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Bho, abhii mundo jwajhohine lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga abhii ghome akilongela kuhuma pamwotu ngita chitujhohine twenga nu kujhendelela kulama? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Mbaha mwe ma Mucha, nnyende mukannyokanikiye ilebhe yoha yalonge Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, kubhoke peniya, mmujha mutulongolela ilebhe yoha ghalongile. Twenga natunnyokanikiya nukuhenge lihengo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Na Bhambo Chapanga ngajhoha malobhe ghino, nganobholela nenga, ‘Nyohine malobhe ghibhalonge bhando abha, bhalonge ghambone. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Machiko ghoha ngabhatenda ngita naha kwa mwojho gwenio gwa kunyokonikiya nu kughahenge mahengo malaghalikilo ghango, ghoha angota pamonga na yana yabhe ilebhe yabhe ngayajhendii telatela machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Na ngohe nyende makalobholele bhabhujhe mu mahema ghabhe. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Nambo mwe ma Mucha ntame pamba na nenga, na nenga mbakumpe mihilo jhango na malaghalikilo na hadabulo yango yoha impa kwabhola bhakamule kukilambo chimbakwape kibhehe chabhe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Mabhando bhuku Ichilahele mma miho kukila kilebhe chahamulicha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Ntenda kila kilebhe ngita chilaghilwe. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Maghakamula ghoha kupala ilebhe ino inyendela telatela na kupala nnyendelela kubhehe ghome, mu kilambo champii Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe chino.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Lilaghalikilo likolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Lende ndi lilaghalikilo na nhwilo, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino gwanhamulicha nimmole. Kupala maghatenda gheniya kukilambo kunyenda kutama nu kubhehe jhino. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Kipinde choha chimpakubhehe maghome, mangota na yana ino mipalwa kunnyokanikiya hake Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kughajhoha malaghalikilo ghoha ghampile, yene mihoto kubhehe maghome mu kilambo chenio machiko ghamahele. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Nnyokanikiya Makaichilahele, maghajhoha nukughakamula ghoha kupala ilebhe ino inyendela telatela na mmelekana ndii mu kilambo chikihalalii kulema nu kukoleka ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhino chalaghila.”<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Unnyokanikiya mwe Maichilehele, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito ndi Chapanga jhumo tugha. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Mupale Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kumwojho gwino ghoha na kihuke chino choha na makakala ghino ghoha. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mangalibhilila jhe mihilo jhenje jhininaghalikiya deleno. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Mabhola yana ino. Mmujhila na kubhujhila kwachimulila pimibhehe kajhino amu pumigholoka amu pimipomolela amu pumijhimuka. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Ntabhalila mulubhoko lwino nu nkwinda gheniya mukibhonge chino ngita ukombokelo. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Helehela nnyandika mihilo jhenje mu mafelemo gha milyango jha nyumba ino nu unane mu matangala ghi ilambo ino mikolongwa.”<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwapwatalila bhando bhangajhoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Anda naha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino pabhalapila akahokobhino Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu, kubhehe apakwape ilambo yiibhi na miche mikolongwa inakuhalala yangachenga mangota. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Nyumba itwelii ilebhe yambone yangabheka mangota nakubhaha na ilibha yangahemba mangota na mighonda jhi micheitune na michabibo jhangapanda mangota. Bhambo Chapanga papakumpeleka kukilambo chenie namma nachakulya choha chimikipala, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />peniya mipalwa kubhehe miho mangannibhilila jhe Bhambo Chapanga jwammohita kukilambo chuku Michile, kwamakibha makabhanda. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Muntembekela hake Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino muntumikila jwenio kanjika ndo na nnapila kwa liina lyake tu. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Mangajhinamii jhe ichapanga jhenge, pakate jha inyagho ya bhando bhimitama nabho, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ikoto kujhaka panane jhino nhwalo Chapanga jwabhii panakate jhino ndi Chapanga jhuna wiho.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Mangannyigha jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ngita piminyighita kwenio ku Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Mma miho na kuitembekeya mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino na malaghalikilo ghake ghannaghalikiya. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Nhwenga kilebhe chikinhalalicha Bhambo Chapanga kupala ilebhe ino innyendela telatela, mu kilambo chimijhingii nu kutola kilambo china kuhalala nu kubhehe chino chabhalaghila Bhambo Chapanga kwape akahoko bhino. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />Yene Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chabhabhenga akamakoko bhino ngita chalongila.”<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Machiko ghighaika, anda yana ino inkonyite, Kwanike Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito kutulaghalikiya tutembekeya mihilo jhenjeno? <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Mangota majhangula naha, ‘Tukibha twakabhanda bha Falao kukilambo chuku Michile, na Bhambo Chapanga ngatukombwila kwa makakala ghake. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Kwa miho ghito ngatummona Bhambo Chapanga akatenda nginyililo na ikangacho na ilebhe yukujhoghowa hake na itapahu kwa Akamichile na Falao na bhando bhake bhoha, <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />nukubhowa ku Michile nukutubheka pamba nu kutupe kilambo chenje ngita palaghila kubhehe nabhapela akahoko bhito. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito ngatulaghila tuitembekeya malaghalikilo ghanga ghoha nakunyokonikiya Bhambo Chapanga. Anda tutehi naha natujhendelela telatela nu kubhehe ghome machiko ghoha ngita chibhii deleno. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Anda tujhendelile kuijhokonikiya mihilo jhenio nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ngita chalaghalikiye, peniyo naibhaha tujheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Bhando bhibhahaghulilwe na Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Kubhoka 34:11-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ipakumpeleka kukilambo chimpakujhenda kutola kubhehe jhino, naghabhenga bhando bha makabila ndii ghabhoke mu kilambo chenio, pumichocha kujhenda nnonge, naghabhenga nnonge jhino bhando bha makabila chaba ghina makakala kupeta mangota, makabila ghenie ndi Akahite na Akagiligache na Akaamole na Akakaane na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Kipinde chenio Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, papakwatenda makamule nukwahotola, mangota mipalwa kwakoma hilu mangalaghana nabho jhe hilu mangakole kiya jhe. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Mangatolana nabho jhe, hilu mwana gwino mangaleka jhe bhatolane nabho. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Nhwalo anda ntehi yenio, nabhahotola kwalongoya yana hino kuijhinamii ichapanga jhenge. Na anda ipitii yenio, Bhambo Chapanga nanchimwangana mangota na kunkoma pulutu kajhombe. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nambo mangota ntenda naha, ntilunane chehemo jhichengitwe yukupikii litambiko Chapanga na kuheketa heke yake. Na nhangabhane inyagho ya ichapanga jwabhe Ashela nukutiniya mwotu inyagho yabhe yukubhacha. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Ntende yenio nhwalo mangota ndi bhando bhinnyeketilwe palonge jha Chapanga gwino. Mu ilambo yoha pannema anhaghuline mangota mme bhando bhake bha kanjika.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Bhambo Chapanga ampalangine jhe mangota nu kuhaghula mangota chi nhwalo mangota mikibha bhamahele kupeta bhando bhange, nhwalo makibha bhandina tugha kupeta bhando bhoha. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Nambo nhwalo Bhambo akatehi kumpala mangota na nhwalo Bhambo ikamuu malaghano ghalapila kwa akahoko bhino, chene ndi chikinkangita ammohe ku lubhoko luna makakala mmoke mubhanda, kubhoka mu mabhoko gha Falao, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Yene, umanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ndi Chapanga gwino, ndi Chapanga jwanhobholeka jwakamuu malaghano ghake nu kwatende ghambone kwa maelufo gha ibheluko kwa bhala bhibhakamuu mihilo jhake, <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />nambo abhe jhe nikiholo kwahadabula bhando bhangakamuu nu kuhalibii mihilo jhake. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Yene, mukilolekeye maha kukamuu mihilo na malaghalikilo na mapalano ghake jhinimpela deleno.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mota kwa bhando bhibhatembekeya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">Kombokela 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Anda mitembekii mihilo jhenje nu kuikamula kukuhobholeka, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nalibhilila jhe lilaghano lyake nu kunangiya umbone kwino ngita chalaghina na akahokobhino. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Nampalangana nu kumpe mota na mangota nanyonjekeka nu kubhehe twe ibheluko hino. Mighonda jhino nahitenda ibhehe na mota, mmota yakulya na divaye na mahuta gha micheitune. Helahela nampela mota jha ipugho ng'ombi na mambelele hoko, mu kilambo chabhalaghila akahokobhino kubhehe nampela mangota. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Nankola na mota kuliku bhando bhoha pannema, pakate jhino nabhe jhe mundo ntonga hilu inyama ino naileka jhe kubhelekana. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Bhambo Chapanga nankengelela na malwalo ghoha ghighajhoghowa, nanalwa jhe ngita chinalwita kukilambo chuku Michile, nambo malwalo gheniya nabhapela akamakoko bhino. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Mipalwa makoma bhando bhoha bhilambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nabhantenda mahotole, mangabhone kiya jhe. Na mangajhinamii jhe ichapanga yabhe, nhwalo kilebhe chenio nakibhaha ntambo kwino.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Mangabhe jhe nikiholo kubhehe bhando abha bhabhii twe kupeta twenga, natuhotola bhole kwabhenga pikilambo? <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Mangapwele jhe bheniya, nkombokela ghaghalaghala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, chantendila Falao, munahota nkolongwa na bhando bhoha bhuku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Nkomboka mabulo ghukujhoghowa ghinnolita kwa miho ghino ikangacho na nginyililo pamonga na makakala makolongwa na uhotolo nkolongwa gwatendita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kunkombola, yene ndi chapakwatenda bhando bheniya bhimapwelela. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Kuchocha kwa gheniya, Bhambo Chapanga napeleka manyigho kwakoma bhala bhibhatila nu kujhobha. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Yene, mangapwelela jhe, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino abhii pamonga na mangota, jwenio ndi Chapanga jhuna makakala na jhukujhoghowa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nabhakoma bhando bha makabila gheniya kachoko kachoko kila pimighaheghelela. Nabhakoma jhe mala jhimo, nhwalo anda ntehi yene mmanya inyama yukumanyahe naichocha nu kuchumbuwa. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nabhatenda mahotole akamakoko bhino na kwatenda bhapwelela ade bhakomelekeye njwenjwe. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Chapanga nantenda makamule akanahota akakolongwa bhabhe. Namakoma na kwalibhilila njwenjwe. Abhii jhe mundo jwapakunhotola ade pumpakwakoma. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Inyagho yoha mitiniya mwotu, manganoghe jhe na madine gha feza yabhe hilu chaabo yabhe na mangatenda jhe kubhehe ino. Anda ntehi yene naubhaha ntambo kwino na ilebhe yaichimwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Inyagho yenie mangajhingii nayo jhe munyumba ino, anda ntehi yene natola likoto lyabhe, mipalwa michimwa nu kuipucha inyagho yenio nhwalo ibhii nilikoto lya Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Kilambo chikihalalii chimijhenda kutola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Mipalwa kukengama maha mihilo jhinimpekeya deleno, kupala ntame nu kujhonjekeka kubhehe twe, nu kujhenda kukilambo chikibhehe chino ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chalaghila kwape akahoko bhino. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Nkomboka Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, channongwiya umwanja kupete munjenga kwa yaka makome ncheche, kupala alole anda chakaka mmi chakaka kunyokanikiya ammanye ghumuwachii kumwojho gwino pange jhe namwikamula mihilo jhake. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Nganyigha kukunneka na njala, palonge ngampila chakulya cha mana nkwipe, changakimanya mangota na akahokobhino. Atehila yene kupala ammole kubhehe mundo alama jhe kulibumunda, nambo kwa kila lilobhe lilibhoka kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Kipinde choha cha yaka makome ncheche, ngobho ino ikalalite jhe hilu makongono gwino ghatupita jhe. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Nkomboka kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino unapula mundo ngita tate chanapuu mwana mundo. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Yene nkamula mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kupala ntame kukukengama jwenie na kunyokanikiya. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino inneta mikilambo chikibholile, kilambo china ngemba na chembwe na mache ghighapitii mululambo na mwiitombe, <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />kilambo chikulema ngano na chaile na michabibo na mitine na makomamanga, kilambo chikibhii na micheitune jhipiya mahuta na bhuche, <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />kwenio nampata yakulya twe na hele nampelulwa jhe kilebhe. Mandalabho ghake gha choma na itombe yake nanhotola kuhemba shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Kwenio nanyakila nukujhukuta na mangota namnchengula Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kukumpe kilambo chambone chikibholile.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangannibhilila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Mucha ngajhendilila kulonge, manganibhilila jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kukuhangabhana malaghalikilo ghake na mihilo jhake na malaghano ghake ghannaghila deleno. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Kipinde pumpa kulye nu kujhukuta, nu kuchenga majhumba mahalanaho nu kutama mwenio, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />na kipinde mipugho jhino jha ng'ombi na mambelele pighapa kujhonjekeka, na madine gha feza na chaabo na kila kilebhe chikipa kujhonjekeka, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />mma miho, miojho jhino jhangabhe jhe nulukilo nu kunibhilila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jwammohita kukilambo chuku Michile, kwamakibha akabhanda. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Jwenio ndi jwannongwiya munjenga ngolongwa jhinakujhoghowa, na jhina majhoka ghina uchongo na ipyelele. Linjenga lyenio lijhomo lyangamache, ngampekiya mache kubhoke mulindalabho linonopaho. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Kabhele jwenio ndi ngampila mana kunjenga, chakulya changakimanya akahokobhino. Atendila yenio kupala kummeka kukuntembeke nu kunnyigha, kupala ampele ilebhe yambone pukupehekeya. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Yene ntama maha, mangahika jhe kukiloke umwojho gwino kubhehe, tubhii niilebhe mbwe kwa makakala na malango ghito twabhete. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Nkomboka kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ndi jwampila uhotolo ghughupata ilebhe mbwe. Atehila yene kupala kulilenganikiya lilaghano lyalaghina na akahokobhino ade ngohe. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Nambo anda munnibhalile Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kuikengama ichapanga jhenge nu kuijhinamila, nimpwatalila ku ukale deleno, chakaka mipakujhomwoka. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Anda nukunyokanikiya jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mmanya mpa kukomwa ngita chibhakoma bhando bhange bhubhabhii nnonge jhino.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Bhando bhangannyokanikiya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Kubhoka 32:1-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Unyokanikiya mwe Akaichilahele! Ngohe mmandikii kujhomboka lukemba lwa Yoludane, kujhenda kukitola kilambo kibhehe chino, kilambo china bhando bhina makakala kumpeta mangota na miche jhabhe ikolongwa ibhii na mapamanda ghighahikii kumahunde. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Bhando bheniya akatandamaho na bhina makakala, bheniya ndi Akaanake ngita bhando bhikilonge kubhehe, Meneke jwahotwii kulimbana na Akaanake? <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Nambo deleno mmanye kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nanninnongolela ngita mwotu ghutiniya mikongo. Jwenie nabhakomelekeya nabhalepelela nnonge jhino, yene mangota namabhenga na kwakomela kipinde tugha, ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino papakwabhenga bhando bheniya nnonge jhino, mangakikweya jhe umiojho jhino kubhehe nhwalo kujheketelwa kwito nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga ndi nhwalo atupii kilambo chenje, naijhe! Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino abhabhengite bheniya nnonge jhino nhwalo bheniya bhanganandela. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Nnhotwile kutola kilambo chenio kubhehe chino chi kunhwalo mangota mabhando bhambone jhe na mwojho gwa umbone, nambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino abhabhengite bheniya kwa nhwalo bhando bheniya bhanganandela nu kupala kulenganikiya lilaghano lyalapila kwa akahokobhino Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Bhahe, mmanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ampilingine kilambo chenio chikibholii, chi kwa nhwalo jha mangota mabhando bhaumbone palonge jhango! Nambo mangota mabhando bha kujhundupa miojho.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Nkombokela na mangalibhilii ng'o kubhehe mangota mukatehi abhe nililaka Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kunjenga. Kuhumii lichiko lyamabhoka kukilambo chuku Michile ade pamahika pamba, mangota nnyendilila kung'alambuka Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ata kukitombe chuku Holebo liina lenge Chinae ngamuntenda Bhambo Chapanga abhe nililaka, ngapala kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Pinhobhokila pikitombe kupoke ibao ibhele ya maghanga ijhandikwe lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lyabhekita na mangota, ngandamita kwenio machiko makome ncheche, kilo na muhe, nalii jhe kilebhe hilu nanywii jhe kilebhe. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Kipinde chenio Bhambo Chapanga ngambila ibao ibhele imaghanga ijhandikwe nulubhoko lwake jwenie, ikibha ijhandikwe malobhe ghoha ghannobholila mangota kuhumii pamwotu lichiko lela lyankongina pikitombe. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Ena, pughapetita machiko gheniya makome ncheche kilo na muhe, Bhambo Chapanga ngambila ibao ibhele ya maghanga yajhandike malaghano.”<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kubhehe, nhuluke pahe jhikitombe kajhombe, nhwalo bhando bhino bhimabhohita ku Michile bhanemwiye na bhatehi ghanganandela. Bhilekite mihilo kajhombe jhinalaghila nu kughalambukii inyagho yukuyana bhene.<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Helahela Bhambo Chapanga ngalonge kubhehe, abhamanye bhando bhamba kubhehe bhina lighoho hake, <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />uneke nakome bhando bhamba mbute liina lyabhe pannema, nane nanatenda kubhehe matate bha kilambo kikolongwa jha bhando bhina makakala kwapeta bheniya.<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Peniya ngang'alambwika, nganhulwika pikitombe kongo ngamwii ibao ibhele ya maghanga ijhandikwe malaghano. Kipinde chenio mwotu ujhakita pikitombe. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Pinolita nganolita kubhehe, muntendii uhakaho Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ntendikii kinyagho chilitohe lya ng'ombi, nng'alambwike kajhombe nilekite mihilo jhanaghila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Peniya ngandondobhiya nu kutaghii pahe ibao yenio, na ngaikajhwinika nnonge jhabhe. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Bhahe, ngang'wila mangukama nnonge jha Bhambo, ngita pundumbwila machiko makome ncheche, kilo na muhe, changalye chakulya hilu kunywe mache, ndehila naha nhwalo gwa malemwa ghuntehilingine mangota nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kukuntenda akola lilaka. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Nyogwipa lindoghondogho nililaka lya Bhambo Chapanga kwino mangota ngankomite, nambo Bhambo Chapanga kipinde chenio ngannyoa kabhele. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Helahela Bhambo Chapanga akibha nililaka hake kwa Alune ngapala kunkoma papa, nanenga kipinde cheche nganninyopila kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Peniya, ngandoila kilebhe changanandela, yane kinyagho cha litohe lya ng'ombi chimitendikiya ngandiniya mwotu, ngatimbitandimbita nukuyogha likuliku ngaliho, maliho ghene ngandaghila mukipela chikikuka mache kuhelela mu kitombe chenio.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Helahela ngamuntenda Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino akola lilaka pimikibha kwenio ku Tabela nu ku Macha nuku Kibolote Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Na Bhambo Chapanga pantumita kubhoka ku Kadeshi Beneya palongila, nnyendengane mukatame mu kilambo chinnimpile kibhehe chino. Mukannyokanikii jhe hilu kukengama ghala ghanaghilwa. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Kuhumii lichiko linaummanya mangota munkundii lighoho Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Yene ngang'wila mangukama nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga machiko makome ncheche kilo na muhe nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akalongii nabhapuluta bhoha pulutu. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Nenga nganinyopita Bhambo Chapanga kulonge, mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga mangakomelekeya jhe bhando bhino, bhando bhino mabhene, bhando bhimakombwila na kwabhowa kukilambo chuku Michile kuhotolo na makakala ghino makolongwa. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Makomboka akatumiche bhino Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu, mangalingukii jhe lighoho lya bhando bhamba, gwanganandela gwabhe na uhakaho gwabhe. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Bhando bhuku Michile kumutubhohita kola bhangalonge jhe, Bhambo Chapanga kwabhabhohita kupala akankomela kunjenga, kwa nhwalo anhotwii jhe kunyingiya mu kilambo chalaghila nhwalo akatehi kunchimwa mangota. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Mana bhando bheniya ndi bhando bhino mabhene, bhando bhimabhohita kubhoka kukilambo chuku Michile kwa makakala nu kunhotolo gwino nkolongwa.<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Mucha ipokee kabhele mihilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 34:1-10">Kombokela 34:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Mmange kabhele ibao ibhele ya maghanga ngita chintehila yahe puntumbwila, na hele ntendekeya lichanduko lya mbau, kubhoke peniya nkwelanayo kunane kukitombe. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Nane nanyandika kabhele malobhe ghighakajhandikwe muibao ikajhulina, na peniya mmeka yenio mu lichanduko.”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Yene ngandendekiya lichanduko lya nkongo gwa nchita pamonga na ibao ya maghanga ibhele ngita yukutumbula yela na nganhowika nayo kukitombe. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Bhambo Chapanga ndi ngajhandika malobhe ghaghalaghala ngita gha makacho, mihilo kome jhabhatangachila Bhambo Chapanga kubhoke pamwotu lichiko lela linkonganika nhwina jha kitombe. Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngangamwiya ne ibao yenio. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Ngang'alambwika, kubhoke pikitombe na ngita chanaghila Bhambo Chapanga, ngamekita ibao yenio mu lichanduko lintendekiya, na ibhii mu lichanduko lyenio ade ngohe ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhatyanga kubhoke mu ilendela ya maliba ya bhando bhuku Yakane ade ku Mosela. Peniya Alune ngajhomwika nu kunchikwa, Eleazale mwana mundo ngabhila mpiya litambiko chehemo jha tate mundo. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Pughapetita gheniya, ngabhatyanga ade ku Gudegoda, nu kubhoke ku Gudegoda ade ku Yotebata, chehemo jhina ipela twe ya mache. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Kipinde chenio Bhambo Chapanga ngahagwila bhando bhi likabila lya Akalawe bhabha bhukughegha lichanduko lya lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, bhatumike ngita akapiya matambiko na kwape bhando mota kuliina lyabhe, lyenio ndi lihengo lyabhe ade deleno. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Yene ndi nhwalo bhando bhi likabila lya Akalawe bhakwetii jhe chehemo jhibhapilwe pannema kubhehe jhabhe pamonga na akalongomundo. Chibhajhambulii ndi ichima jha kubhehe akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga, ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito chalaghila.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Mucha ngajhendilila kulonge, ngandamita kukitombe machiko makome ncheche kilo na muhe ngita makacho, peniya Bhambo Chapanga nganyokanikiya kabhele yene ngajheketila kubhehe nabhakoma jhe. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila kubhehe, “Mmoke pamba, nnyendelele na mwanja gwino mwalongoche bhando bheniya bhakajhingile nu kutola kilambo kubhehe jhabhe, chanaghina akahokobhabhe kubhehe chanapela.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakipala Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Ngohe maka Ichilahele, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kilebhe chakipala kwino, munnyinamila jwenio na kuhenga kila chakipala. Mupale na kuichimu na kuntumikila kuhuke gwino ghoha na kwa mwojho gwino ghoha, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />na kujhokonikiya malaghalikilo ghake na mihilo jhake jhinnimpela deleno kwa nhwalo gwino mabhene. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Dola, kunane na ata kunane kwa Chapanga hake ndi ya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino na nnema na yoha ibhii mwenio ndi yake. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapala hake akahokobhino, ndi ngabhahagwila mangota bhumii ibheluko ya bheniya, kubhehe bhando bhake chehemo jha bhando bhange bhoha, ngita chibhii deleno. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Kuhumii ngohe munnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, na mileka ngandango. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ndi Chapanga jwa ichapanga na Bhambo jwa akanahota akakolongwa na Chapanga jwa akanahota bhina makakala na bhibhajhokanikiya, iloleke jhe kumiho jha bhando na ijhekete jhe chwinda. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Abhakenge akakebha na akanawela na jwenio abhapala akaghene bhibhatama pamonga na twenga kwape chakulya na ngobho. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Yene, mapale akaghene nhwalo namangota mukibha akaghene ku kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Munnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kunnyinamila jwenio kanjika ndo. Mangalekana jhe na jwenio nu kulapila kwa liina lyake kanjika ndo. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Munnombe jwenio, nhwalo jwenio ndi Chapanga gwino na jwenio antendii ikangacho yukujhoghowa ghinnolokiya kwa miho ghino mabhene. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Akahokobhino pibhajhenda ku Michile, bhakibha bhando makome chaba tugha, nambo ngohe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino atehii mme twe ngita ndondo yukunane kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukolongwa gwa Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Kwa nhwalo gwenio, mupale Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nu kughakamuu ghake machiko ghoha na mihilo jhake na malaghano na malaghalikilo ghake. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Nkomboka deleno chi yana ino imanyii jhe hilu ikalolite jhe mang'ahe gha Bhambo Chapanga hilu uhotolo nu ukolongwa gwake, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />na nginyililo na ikangacho yake yatehila kwa Falao, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile na kilambo chake choha. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Yana ino ikalolite jhe chabhatendii akakomana ngondo bheniya bha Akamichile, falache yabhe na mutuka yabhe ya ngondo, na chibhatehila bhamilwe mumbwane jha Chamo pibhajhighita kwakengamila. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Helahela nkomboka yana ino bhaghabhwei jhe ghateila Bhambo Chapanga kunjenga kabula jhu kuika pambano. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Ilebhe yantendii Datane na Abilamo, yana ya Eleabo, Eleabo akibha mwana jwa Leubene. Pibhakibha nnonge jha bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, nnema puyekwika na kwamila pamonga na akalongo mundo, mahema ghabhe na inyama na akatumiche bhabhe bhoha. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Nambo kwa miho ghino mangota ngannolita itendwa yoha, yenio ikolongwa yatehila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mota mukilambo chalaghila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Mikamula mihilo jhoha jhininnaghalikiya deleno, kupala nhotola kujhomboka lukemba Yoludane nu kujhingila na kutola kilambo chimikijhendela kubhehe chino, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />kupala ntama kwa machiko twe mu kilambo chenie chikihalalii kulema nu kukoleka. Kilambo chenio Bhambo Chapanga aghalaghine kwape akahoko bhino na ibheluko yabhe. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Nhwalo kilambo chimikijhende kutola kubhehe chino chi ngita kilambo chuku Michile, kummokite, kummichita mbojhe nu kujhitilila mache kwa magholo ngita buchitane jhi likolo. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Nambo kilambo chikijhenda kutola kubhehe chino, ndi kilambo chikibhii niitombe na mang'engo, kilambo chikipata hula kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />kilambo chenio Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino naitunja na uilolekeya pikitumbulii chaka ade pukijhomoke chaka.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Bhahe, anda mijhokaniki mihilo jhinnimpelengana deleno, nu kumupala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nu kuntumikii kwa mwojho gwino gwoha ni kihuke chino choha, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />jwenio nakichepecheya hula kilambo chino kipinde chake, hula jhikihuko na hula jhi kikokolelo cha lupe, yene nahunangana mahuno na divaye na mahuta gha micheitune kwa nhwalo gwino. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Namelecha manyahe kuhwalo jha ipugho ino, namangota nanyakila nu kujhukuta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mukilolokeye, miojho jhino jhingangekebhuka jhe nu kughalambukila na kuitumikii ichapanga jhenge nu kuijhinamila, <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />anda ntehi yene, lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga nalinyakila mangota, nahibhilikiya hula ikoto kukoma, nannema nauleka kupiya mahuno ghake. Peniya nankomelekeya kajhombe nu kubhoka mu kilambo chambone, champela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Malobhe ghanga ghabha umwojho gwino nu muhuke gwino. Mughatabha mu mabhoko ghino nukuwala mu ibhonge ino ngita huna jhuku nkombocha. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Mangota mabhola yana ino. Mmujhila kabhele pumme kajhino amu pumme undela amu pimipomolela amu pimijhimuka. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Kabhele nnyandika mihilo jhenje mufelemo jha milyango jhino na unane jha matangala makolongwa gha kilambo chino, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />kupala mangota na ibheluko ino ntama machiko twe, mu kilambo chilaghila Bhambo Chapanga kwape akahoko bhino. Nantama kwenio machiko ghoha ngita hela chibhii kwenio kunane kwa Chapanga chikujhendelela machiko ghoha panane jha nnema.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Anda mwikamwi maha nukutenda mihilo jhoha jhinimpela na kumpala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kukengama ndela yake yoha, nukulombona nde na jwenio, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nabhabhenga bhando bhoha bhi ilambo henge nnonge jhino, mangota nantola chenio kilambo cha bhando twe bhina makakala hake, kupeta mangota nu kubhehe chino. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila chehemo jhimpakulebhata kwa njajho ya makongono ghino, napabhaha pino. Kilambo chino nakijhenela kuhumii kunjenga, upande gwa kuchine, ade mwitombe yu ku Lebanone, upande gwa kachikachine, nu kuhumii pu lukemba lwa Efulate kulihumii lyobha, ede Medetelaniya, upande ghulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Abhii jhe mundo jhojhoha jwapakunhibhilikiya. Popoha pipakujhenda mu kilambo chenio, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nabhatenda bhando bhannyoghope, ngita chalaghila.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Dolekeya, deleno jheno nibheka palonge jhino mota na likoto. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Naibha mota kwino anda mijhokanikiya mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhinnimpelangana deleno, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />nambo nampata likoto anda mijhokanikiya jhe mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kujhileka ndela jhanaghila, nu kujhinamii ichapanga henge jhangaimanya. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Bhambo Chapanga papakunhikicha pi kilambo chimijhenda kutola kubhehe chino, mitangacha mota kubhoke pikitombe cha Gelechimo na likoto kubhoke pukitombe cha Ebale. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Itombe henge ibhii kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane, kuupandi ghulitipikii lyobha mwa ndela jhijhenda kulitipikii lyobha, mu kilambo chuku Kaanane, bhibhatama kwenio ku Alaba mwiye na mwiye na Giligale. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Pimipalwa kujhomboka lukemba Yoludane nnyingile nu kutola kilambo champii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Bhahe, kipinde pimpa kutola nu kubhehe kilambo chino nu kutama mwenio, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />mangota mipalwa kuikamuu mihilo jhoha na malaghalikilo ghinimpela deleno.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Chehemo jhakanjika pakujhinamila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Ghanga ndi malaghalikilo na mihilo jhimipalwa kuikamuu nu kukengama mu kilambo champii Bhambo Chapanga jwa akahoko bhino, kubhehe chino machiko ghoha ghimpakutama mu kilambo chenie. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Mipatilulana njwe chehemo jhoha pibhajhope bhando ichapanga yabhe, mwitombe itandamaho na mwiikola jha mu mikongo mikolongwa jhibhii na mahamba mabhehe. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Mitilulana okwe chehemo yabhe yoha jhukupikiya nu kutupulii okwe heke yabhe. Mwitiniya kwa mwotu huna ya inyagho ya ichapanga ikemwa Ashela, na kuitwikulana inyagho yabhe yukubhacha nu kuputilii okwe liina lyabhe lya chehemo jhenio.”<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Wala minganyinamii jhe Bhambo Chapanga gwino, ngita chibhaijhinamii bheniya ichapanga yabhe. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Nambo nannyenda chehemo pahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mu makabila ghoha kupa kulibheka liina lyake ni kitamo chake peniya, kwenio ndi kumipala kujhenda kunnyinamila. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Kwenio ndi kumipalwa kupeleka matambiko ghino ghukukomelekeya na matambiko ghange, na matambiko gha lipungo lya kome na matambiko gha nachile na matambiko gha kupala mabhene mangota na matibho gha ng'ombi na mbuhe nu mambelele ghino. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Kwenio mijhakila nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mihanganila mangota pamonga na bhando bha kajhino nhwalo jha mota jhampii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Mangatenda jhe ngita chimitenda ngoheno, kila mundo chapala kutenda jwenio, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />nhwalo mwamela manajhingii jhe chehemo jhu pakutama njelembo nu kutola kilambo jhimpakupela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Nambo pumipa kujhomboka lukemba Yoludane nu kutama mu kilambo chapakumpe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kubhehe chino na kutama njelembo, na jwenie nantenda mpomolele nkotokuchumbulilwa na akamakoko bhino bhoha bhibhapakuntindila, <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />kwenio chehemo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino papakuhaghula kubhehe chehemo jha kitamo cha Liina lyake, peniya ndi pimipalwa kutoteka kila chinninaghalikiya, matambiko ghino ghukukomelekeya na matambiko ghange, gha mapungu gha kome na matambiko gha nachile ghinnaghii kumpikiii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Peniya nuhangana nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangota pamonga na yana ino inalome na ikeghe, akatumiche bhino akanalome na akakeghe na Akalawe bhibhatama mu miche jhino, nhwalo bheniya bhakwetii jhe chehemo jhibhapilwa jhabhe pakate jhino. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mikilolokeye, mangapiya jhe matambiko ghino ghu kukomelekeya chehemo jhojhoha jhimipala mabhene, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />nambo matambiko ghino mpiya chehemo jhela tugha jhihaghulilwe na Bhambo Chapanga pakate jha kilambo chino. Peniya ndi pimipalwa kuleta litambiko lino li kukomelekeya, nukukamwu ghoha ghinninaghalikiye.”<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Nambo mihoto kunchinja nu kulye inyama ino papoha pimipala kutama. Mihoto kulye inyama yamahele ngita hela chamipala ngita hela champela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Bhando bhibhajheketilwe amu bhangajheketelwa, bhihoto kulye nyama jhenio, ngita chimilye nyama jha mbabhala amu oloko. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Nambo mangalye jhe myahe jha inyama yenio, myahe jhenio mijhitila muundope ngita mache. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Mangalye jhe ilebhe henge yumumpikii Bhambo Chapanga chehemo jhgha mitama, lipungo lya kome lya mahuno ghino hilu divaye jhino hilu mahuta ghino gha micheitune hilu matibho gha ng'ombi amu mbuhe na mambelele ghino amu matambiko gha nachile amu matambiko ghino mabhene amu matambiko ghange. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Nambo nanyakila ilebhe yenio nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, chehemo jhapakuhaghuu Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Nanyakila mangota pamonga na yana ino inalome pamonga na ikeghe na akatumiche bhino akanalome na akakeghe na Akalawe bhibhatama mu miche jhino. Mipalwa nhwanganila nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Helahela mipalwa, mangalibhalili jhe Akalawe machiko ghoha ghimpakutama pikilambo chino.”<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, papakujhonjeke mipaka jha kilambo chino, ngita channaghila, namangota nannongela kubhehe, ‘Tupala kumemena nyama,’ nhwalo mipala nyama, peniya mihoto kumemena nyama tane jhino. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Bhahe, chehemo jhapakuhaghula Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, abheke liina lyake, peniya nanhotola kunchinja ng'ombi amu limbelele lyolyoha lyampile Bhambo Chapanga ngita channaghila, na mihoto kulye nyama jhenio tane jhino, anda mmii mu miche jhino. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Mmemena nyama jhenio ngita chimimemena nyama jha mbabhala amu oloko. Mundo jhojhoha ihoto kumemena, jwajheketilwe kunnyinamiii Chapanga na jwangajheketelwa kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Nambo mipalwa myahe mangalye jhe nyama jhina myehe, nhwalo myahe ndi ughome, yene mangalye jhe ughome pamonga na nyama. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Mangalye jhe myahe jhenio, nambo mijhitila paundope ngita mache. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Anda namukengama nhwilo ghongo, Bhambo Chapanga nahanganichwa na mangotana ilebhe ino nainyendela telatela, ichokolo ya yana ino, nhwalo mitenda ghambone nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Ilebhe ino ipiitwe kubhehe ya Bhambo Chapanga na matambiko ghino gha nachile, namwitola nu kuipeleka chehemo jhu kumpikiya Bhambo Chapanga jhapakuhaghula. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Peniya, ndi nampiya matambiko gha kukomelekeya na nyama pamonga na myahe, mu chehemo jhukumpikii litambiko jhapahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, myahe jha kinyama namuimichila mu chehemo jhenio pa kupiikiya litambiko Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nambo nyama mihoto kukememena. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Mipalwa kukamuu malaghalikilo ghanga ghininaghalikiya, kupala ilebhe ino inyendela telatela mangota pamonga na ibheluko ino, machiko ghoha ghangapeta, nhwalo mitenda ghambone na ghabhii tela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujhinamii ichapanga kukanikiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Kipinde Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino papakwabhenga bhando bha ilambo henge nnonge jhino nu kumpela mangota, nambo pimipakwabhenga na nu kutama mangota mu kilambo chabhe, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />mmambala mangakengama jhe ndela jhu kujhinamii ichapanga yabhe nhwalo gwenio ndi ntambo kwino. Hilu mangakonya jhe, ‘Bhando bhamba bhijhinamii bho ichapanga yabhe? Kupala natwenga hele tukajhinamile ngita bheniya.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Mangannyinamii jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ngita bheniya chibhajhinamii ichapanga yabhe, nhwalo kila kilebhe chukuchimwa changakipala Bhambo Chapanga pibhajhinamila ichapanga yabhe. Kabhele bhahipiya yana yabhe inalome na ikeghe kubhehe matambiko ghu kukomelekeya kwa ichapanga yabhe.”<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Mipalwa kutenda kila kilebhe chinninaghalikiye, mangapongocha jhe kilebhe hilu kujhonjekeya kilebhe.”<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Andaapitii nnondole jwa Chapanga jwakuchimulii maloto pakate jhino, annobholile kumpe nginyililo amu ikangacho, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />peniya nginyililo amu ikangacho yenie itendeke, peniya nalongela kubhehe, ‘Tuikengame ichapanga jhenge nu kuijhinamila, ichapanga yangaimanya,’ <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />mangajhokanikiya jhe malobhe gha nnondole jwenio amu machimulilo ghake, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino apete kwa bheniya kunnyigha mangota kupala amanye anda mumpala kwa mwojho gwino ghoha na kwa kihuke chino choha. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Munkengame nu kunnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kukamuu mihilo jhake nu kujhokanikiya lilobhe lyake, nukunnyinamila jwenio kanjika. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Nambo nnondole jwenio amu nnota maloto nakomwa, nhwalo abhabholite lughaluko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jwammohita kukilambo chuku Michile na kwankombwila kubhanda, kupala mwileke ndela jhannaghila Bhambo Chapanga mwiikengame. Yene ndi chimpala kukomelekeya gwanganandela pakate jhino.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Anda unnung'una gwino jwa lutumbo lumo amu mwana gwino munalome amu mwikeghe, amu aana bhino bhimapala hake, amu nkoche gwino jhumumpala hake, nahwuta kwa chile nalongela kubhehe, ‘Tujhende tukaijhinamii ichapanga,’ ichapanga jhenio mwenga amu akahoko bhino minawahii jhe bhikaijhinamila, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />amu ichapanga jha bhando bhange bhibhatama pahina jhino amu kutale kubhoke upande ghumo gwa nnema ade ghonge, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />mangajheketela jhe kunkolowa hilu mangannyokanikiya jhe hilu kunkole kiya amu manganneka jhe ajhende amu mangannonda jhe, <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />chakaka ipalwa mukomwa, mipalwa mwe mma jhukutumbula kunkong'onda lighanga, peniya, bhando bhange nabhabweleya. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Munkong'onda maghanga ade aweghe! Nhwalo ajhighite kunnekanicha na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jwammohita mu kilambo chuku Michile kumikibha makabhanda. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Pimpakwakoma bhando bheniya, Akaichilahele bhoha nabhajhoha nu kujhoghopa, hilu bhitenda jhe nhwanangana ngita gwenio.”<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Pumpakutama mu kilambo chenie Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ampilangine ntame pange nannyoha, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kubhehe bhando bhange bhina milomo pakate jhino, bhautite bhando bhikilambo bhilonge, “Tujhende tukaijhinamii ichapanga jhenge,” ichapanga jhenio mwamela munaimanya jhe, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />bhahe, milingukiya nu kukonyekeya maha, anda chakaka kilebhe kibhoho chenio kitendike pakate jhino, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />mipalwa kwakoma kwa upanga bhando bhoha bha muche gwenie, nu kuikoma ng'ombi yoha kwa mapanga na mikihalibiyana kilambo chenio. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Mijhola ilebhe yoha ya bhando bhibhatamita muche gwenio nu kuipeleka pulubhanja nu kuitiniya mwotu ngita pimikomelekeya matambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, muche gwenio naubhaha malundo na mahame machiko ghoha ghangapeta, na helahela nauchengwa jhe kabhele. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Mangatola jhe kilebhe chochoha chikipihitwe kutiniwa mwotu kubhehe chino, kupala Bhambo Chapanga alileka lilaka lyake likale, aghamanye ghambone na kiya nu kummeka mma twe hake ngita chalaghina na akahoko bhino, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />anda tugha munnyokanikii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kukamuu mihilo jhake jhoha jhinnighalikiya deleno.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Kulela malelo kukukanilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Mangotamwe makayana bha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mingikilemba nembo jhe hilu kucheku lupala kunhwalo gwa mundo jwajhomwike ngita chibhatehila bhange. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Mangotamwe mabhando bha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, bhanhagwii mangota kubhehe bhando bhake, pakate jha bhando bhoha bhibhatama pannema.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyama ijheketelwa kulegwa na yangajheketelwa kulegwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Akalabhe 11:1-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Mangalye jhe kilebhe chochoha chikikanikilwe palonge jha Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Nambo inyama bhimihoto kulye ndi henge, ng'ombi na mambelele na mbuhe, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />mbabhala na oloko na mbuhe nhwitu na kipalama na mbalape na ndandala, <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />na kila kinyama china kipagha chikibhaghanike pabhele na chikidukula yene ndi mihoto kulyegha. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Nambo mangalye jhe kinyama chochoha kipagha chake changabhaghanika na kiduku jhe, ngamiya na kipecha na kichechele, ipachuke jhe ipagha yabhe, yenio naintenda bhangajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Na ligholobhe mangalye jhe, pamo libhii nikipagha chikibhaghanike nambo liduku jhe, lyenio kujheketelwa jhe nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. Yene mangalye jhe nyama jhi inyama yenie hilu mangapapaha jhe mituhe jhake.”<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Mihoto kulye homba yoyoha ina maghabatilo nu mapezi. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Na kila chikitama umache changa mapezi na maghabatilo mangalye jhe, yenio naintenda mangajheketelwa jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Mihoto kulye ijhune yoha ijheketelwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Nambo ijhune henge mangalye jhe, limbanga na kapongo, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />litumbuhe na kapongo mpile na kapongo na limbanga likele, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />na aina jhoha jha mapanga na matumbuhe, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />na kila makongolo kwa aina jhake, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />na litobhunjola jwandina na litobhonjola nkolongwa na litobhonjola nhuo, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />litobhonjola li kunjenga na mahilimila, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />na kinholobhele kinhuo na aina yoha ya inholobhele na lipumbumbu na kinimenime.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />“Idudu yoha ichokombe imbuluka kwa malongo ghake, yenie yoha mangalyengana jhe mangota. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nambo mihoto kulye ihumbe yoha ina mapapanilo ijheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Mangalye jhe kinyama chikijhiwelii chene, mihoto kumpe nng'ene jwaitama mu kilambo chino alyeghe, amu muhoto kunchuluchila mundo jwa kilambo chenge, nhwalo mangota ndi mabhando bha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Mangatutu jhe litohe lya limbelele amu litohe lya mbuhe mu mabhele gha majhe mundo.”<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha lipungo lya kome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Mangakotoka jhe kupiya lipungo lya kome lya mahuno ghino gha mighonda jhino kila chaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Peniya nnyenda palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino papahagwii pakunnyinamila, na kwenio nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, nanyakila mapungu gha kome gha mahuno ghino ghaa divaye na mahuta gha micheitune na gha ng'ombi jhukutumbula kubhelukwa na gha mambelele ghino. Ntendangane yene kupala mikibhole kunnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Anda chehemo jhu kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ibhii kutale kuhumii kajhino nu mangota mihoto jhe kughegha mapungo gha kome gha matambiko ghino gha mahuno ghampii Bhambo Chapanga ntenda naha, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />bhahe, nchulucha ilebhe yenio ya mapungu gha kome nu kutola mbijha yenio ade chehemo pakujhinamila papahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Na mbijha yenio ntumila kukuhemela kilebhe chochoha chamipala, nyama jha ng'ombi na jha mbuhe na jha limbelele na divaye amu chukunywe kikale, mwenga na bhando bha kajhino nnyakila nu kuhanganila nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Mangalibhilii jhe Akalawe bhibhatama pamonga na mangota, nhwalo bheniya bhapalwa jhe chehemo jha kilambo kubhehe chabhe pakate jhino. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Kila pukipala kupehekela chaka chu utato, mpiya lipungo lya kome lya mahuno ghu munng'onda nu kubheka kihukilo mu miche jhino. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Kihukilo chenie nakibhaha kwa nhwalo jha Akalawe, nhwalo bhajhito bhakwetii jhe lipungo hilu chehemo jhabhe pakate jhito, pamonga na akaghene na akakebha na akanahwela bhibhatama pamonga na mangota, bhaika kulye nu kujhukuta. Ntenda yenio, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nampela mota mu mahengo ghino ghoha ghimihenga kwa mabhoko ghino.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Chaka cha chaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Akalabhe 25:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kila pukipehekela chaka cha chaba malekekeya bhimakopile. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Naha ndi chimipalwa ntenda kila jwankopile Mwichilahele nnyake, aliputa lighambo lyenie, mangajhenda kundahe lighambo lyenio, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga jwenie kulekekeya maghambo gheniya. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Mihoto kwaghamba akaghene nambo akalongo bhino Akaichilahele, mangaghamba jhe.<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nampela mota mu kilambo chino champii kubhehe chino, apitii jhe ata jhumo jwapakubhe nhwocho pakate jhino, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />anda tugha namnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga nu kuikamuu mihilo jhake jhinnighalikiya deleno. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nampela mota ngita chalaghila. Namangota namajhahikicha bhando twe, nambo mangota nanyahika jhe. Kabhele nannongocha ilambo twe nambo mwenga nannongochwa jhe.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Anda abhii nnongo gwino nhwocho mu miche jhojhoha jhampii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangabhe na chojho jhe na mangaleka jhe kuntangatila. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Nambo mipalwa mujhahikicha kwa mwojho gwambone kilebhe chochoha chakipala. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Mukilolokeya umwojho gwino pangapitii jhe na liwacho libhoho, kulonge chaka cha chukulekekeya maghambo kibhandikile, nu kukana kumpe kilebhe nnongo gwino, jwenio ahoto kunnelela Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo gwino mwenga, yene mihoto kubhehe nu uhakaho. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mupele nnongo gwino nhwocho kwa mwojho gwambone pangakokoleka, kukutenda yene Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nampela mota mu mahengo ghino ghoha na kila kilebhe chimpa kuhenga. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Akahocho bhabhii pannema machiko ghoha, yene ninaghalikiya kubhehe mma na mwojho gwambone kwa akalongo bhino akahocho mu kilambo.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chimipalwa kwatende akabhanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Kubhoka 21:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Anda abhii nnongo gwino Mwichilahele munalome amu mwikeghe anda ahikite kwino antumikile ngita mmanda kwa yaka chita alepwa chakighana, mipalwa munnekekeya mahulo chaka cha chaba. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Namwe pumpa kunnekekeya mahulo manganneka jhe abhoka mabhoko matopo. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Mupela kwa mwojho kukuhangana ilebhe ino inkwete kubhoke mu mota yampii Bhambo Chapanga, mambelele na mahuno na divaye. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nkomboka kubhehe mangota makibha akabhanda kukilambo chuku Michile na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ngankombwila, ndi nhwalo deleno ninnaghalikiya gheniya.”<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Nambo anda ntumiche gwino alongii, ‘Nibhoka jhe pakajhino pano,’ nhwalo nighana mwenga na akalongo bhino na apaii jwene kutama na mwenga, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />peniya muntola ade pannyango gwa nyumba jhino na peniya nhotola lichikilo lyake kwa luchungulo, na jwenio nabhaha mmanda gwino machiko ghoha ghangapeta. Ntenda helahela kwa mmanda gwino mwikeghe. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Mangabhina mwojho jhe pumunnekeke mmanda gwino mahulo, nhwalo antumikii kwa yaka chita kongo mnepita nucho jha ghala ghighapalitwa kulepwa kwa mundo jwa kuhenga mahengo ghino. Ntenda yenie, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nampela mota kwa kila chimpa kuhenga.”<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyama itumbwii kubhelukwa ng'ombi na mambelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Mupiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino mapongo gha ng'ombi ino na mambelele ghino ghighatumbwila kubhelukwa, na mangape jhe lihengo lyolyoha ng'ombi yenie na mambelele mangaghacheku jhe mangoma. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila chaka, mwe na yana ino mmemene nyama jhi inyama yenie nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chehemo jhela pahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Nambo kinyama chenie akibhii na malola ghoghoha ngita hela kuchepela amu kihakanaho amu kibhii ni kilema kikolongwa amu jwangalola, mangapiya jhe litambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Mmemena nyama jhenie kajhino, bhando bhangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga na bhibhajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga bhihoto kumemena nyama jhenie ngita chimimemena nyama jha mbabhala amu oloko. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Nambo mangalye jhe myahe jhake, myahe jhenie, mijhitila pahe ngita mache pwaa.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa Pachaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Kubhoka 12:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Mmeka unyagho gwa Pachaka mu mwehe gwa Abibo kupala kumpe ichima Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Nhwalo mu mwehe gwenio gwa Abibo, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ngammohita kilo ku kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Pumipiya matambiko gha Pachaka kubhoke mipugho ino gha mambelele na ng'ombi kukunyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, chehemo jhikujhinamila pahagwii Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Litambiko lyenio mangalye jhe pamonga na mabumunda ghighalekii ngedule, ngita chinnila pimabhoka ku Michile kajhombe. Ndi nhwalo mabumunda gheniya ghakemitwa mabumunda gha malagho, kuyene machiko ghoha pimpa kutama kwenio milikomboka lichiko lyenie limabhoka mu kilambo chuku Michile kunnaghita. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Kwa machiko chaba mu kilambo chino mundo jhojhoha angabheka jhe ngedule unyumba jhake, na nyama jhi kinyama chikichinjwite kimiye lichiko likutumbula, ikoto kuhighala ade lukela.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Mipalwa jhe kupiiya litambiko lya unyagho gwa Pachaka mu muche ghoghoha gwapakumpe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.” <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />“Nambo litambiko lyenio lya unyaghao gwa Pachaka namwipiya chehemo papahagwii kupala ajhinamilwa, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, peniya ndi pimpa kupiya litambiko kimiye, lyobha pilipakutipika, kipinde chenio ndi chimmokita ku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Nyama jhenio mitutua nu kulye peniya chehemo papahagwii pa kunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, lukela jhake mibhujha ku mahema ghino. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Kwa machiko chita milyagha mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule na lichiko lya chaba ibha ngonganiko ngolongwa jhi kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino na mangahenga jhe lihengo lyolyoha lichiko lyenie.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa mahuno</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:22">Kubhoka 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Akalabhe 23:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Mibhalanga majhuma chaba kuhumii puntumbwila kuhuna mahuno ghino, <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />peniya mibheka unyagho gwa Mahuno, gwenio ndi unyagho gwa mahuno kumpe ichima Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kwa kumpikiya litambiko kukupala kwino mabhene, mpiya ngita Chapanga pampii mota. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Nauhwangana kumwojho nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangota pamonga na yana ino inalome na yana ino ikeghe akatumiche bhino na Akalabhe na akaghene bhi likabila lenge na akakebha pamonga na akanawela bhibhatama pamonga na mangota. Ntenda gheniya mu chehemo jhikujhinamila papahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kupala munnyinamila kwenio. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Nkomboka kubhehe mangota mukibha makabhanda mu kilambo chuku Michile, yene mipalwa kukamuu malaghalikilo ghanga.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa ichimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Akalabhe 23:33-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Kubhoke pukupuluwa mahuno ghino nu kuminya chabibo ino, ntenda Unyagho gwa Ichimba kwa machiko chaba. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Nhwanganila unyagho gwenio mangotamwe na yana ino inalome na ikeghe na akatumiche bhino, Akalawe na akaghene bhi likabila lenge na akakebha na akanawela bhibhatama mwiilambo ino. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa machiko chaba muntendela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino Unyagho chehemo papahagwii, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ampii mota mahuno ghino ghoha na mahengo ghino ghoha na mangota mihangana mwojho hake.”<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Akanalome bhoha Akaichilahele bhi kilambo chino nabhaika nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mala patato kila chaka, chehemo papahagwii pa kujhinamila. Kipinde cha Unyagho gwa Mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule, gwenio ndi Unyagho gwa Pachaka, unyagho gwa majhuma gwenio ndi Unyagho gwa Mahuno na Unyagho gwa Ichimba. Mangajhenda jhe nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga mabhoko matopo. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Mabhoha mupiya telatela ngita hela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino champii mota yake.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhadabula kukupalwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Mihaghula akatemula na ilongoche bhange kubhoke mu makabila ghino na mwiilambo ino, yapakumpe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, bheniya bhimapakwahaghuu bhahadabula ngita hela chiipalwa. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Mangaghalambula jhe ukwele hilu mangannoleke jhe mundo kumiho hilu mangajhekete jhe kupoke chwinda, nhwalo chwinda ukojholana miho gha bhando bhina malango nu kughalambula mihalo jha bhando ghibhahenga ghapala Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Matendela bhando ngita hela chiipalwa, kupala ntame mu kilambo champii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kubhehe chino.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Mangajhemeka jhe luheke lwa nkongo lululangiya huna jha ichapanga mwikeghe chu uwange jwakemitwa Ashela, pahina na chehemo jhichengwitwe jhi kumpiikiya matambiko, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Hilu mangajhemeka jhe luheke lwa kinyagho cha lighanga, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, aichimwa ilebhe yenio.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Mangapiya jhe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, litambiko likukomelekeya lya ng'ombi amu limbelele lina kilema chochoha, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino aghachimwa gheniya.”<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Anda nnyohine kubhehe, pakate jha miche jhino abhii munalome amu mwikeghe jwatenda ghanganandela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kuhalibiya malaghano ghake, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />kukuijhinamila nu kuitumikila ichapanga henge, amu lyobha amu mwehe amu ndondo ilebhe yenie Chapanga akanite mbe mangaijhinamiii jhe. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Mangota anda nnyohine nhwalo gwenio, mipalwa kulingukiya maha, na anda chakaka kilebhe changanandela chenio chikitendwa pi Ichilahele, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />bhahe, mkangila panja jha muche na mkong'onda maghanga ade bhahwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Chakaka bhipalwa bhakomwa anda bhabhi bhando bhibhalolite bhabhele amu bhatato bhibhalolite. Bhangakomwa jhe anda uchaile gwenio gwa mundo jhumo tugha. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Akachaile bheniya ndi bhibhapalwa kutumbuu kunkong'onda maghanga, peniya bhange bhinkong'onda maghanga. Kukutenda yene, mupakuibhilikiya gwanganandela gwenio pakate jhino.”<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Ihoto kupitii mihalo jhenge minonopo muilambo ngita hela mihalo jhukuhadabula kukoma changamiye amu changanamiye mihalo jha kukocholana na mundo jhonge amu ilebhe ya bhando. Anda ipitii jhenio, mighapeleka chehemo jhikujhinamila jhahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Kwenio mipeleka mihalo jhenio kwa akapiya matambiko Akalawe, na nnyomola mihalo jwabhii mulihengo kipinde chenio, namangota namatakalila nnonge jhabhe na bhene nabhapiya nabhatemulana. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Peniya nabhatemula mihalo jhenio na mangota nantenda ngita hela chibhapakunnobholela. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Nampalwa kuhenga telatela na chimipakulobholelwa. Mangaleka jhe kulenganikiya luhadabulo jhimpakulaghalikilwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Na mundo jhojhoha jwangannyokanikiya mpiya litambiko amu nnyomola mihalo jwabhekitwe mu zamo, mundo jwenio ipalwa akomwa. Kukutenda yenie namuibhangana gwanganandela gwenio mu Ichilahele. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Bhando bhoha nabhalogwa jhe nu kutenda kilebhe ngita chenie.”<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo nhwalo jha munahota nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Pumpakujhingila mukilambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chapakumpe kubhehe chino nu kutama mwenio, na mangota nannongila nnonge, ‘Natummeka munahota nkolongwa atulongoche, ngita bhando bhilambo chibhatutindile,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />mihoto kubhehe mundo kubhehe munahota nkolongwa nambo jwahaghulilwe na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. Ipalwa abhaha jhumo pakate jha akalongo bhino na mangantenda jhe nng'ene kubhehe munahota nkolongwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Pamo na gheniya, munahota nkolongwa jwenio angabhe jhe na kinyama chikikemwa falache hoko kunhwalo gwake, akakomana ngondo bhake amu kwatuma bhando bhakahemele falache kukilambo chuku Michile, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akalongii kubhehe, ‘Bhando bhango nabhabhujha jhe kabhele kwenio.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Na munahota nkolongwa jwenio angatolejhe akakeghe hoku pange jhe mwojho gwake naunneka Bhambo Chapanga, hilu angakijhole jhe mbijha na chaabo ndii hake. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Papakubhehe munahota nkolongwa, ipalwa akijhandikila kabhele kitabo cha malaghalikilo kunhwalo gwake jwenie kubhoke mu kitabo chikibhekitwe kwa akapiya matambiko Akalawe. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Kitabo chenio kibha na jwenio machiko ghoha nu kuchoma muughome gwake ghoha, kupala akibhola kuntembekeya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwake, akamula nu kulenganikiya ghoha ghighajhandikwe mukitabo mwenio. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />na akikweya jhe jwene kwa akalongo mundo nu kukibhona nkolongwa kuliku Akaichilahele bhoha na hilu kuipucha mihilo jhenje kwa namuna jhojhoha kupala ajhendelela kulongocha jwenie na ibheluko yake.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Ilebhe ibhipalwa kupelwa akapiya litambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Akapiya litambiko Akalabhe, yane likabila lyoha lya Akalawe nabhapelwa jhe kilambo ku Ichilahele. Angota bhitama kukupoke lipungo li litambiko lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Wala bhipata jhe kilambo kubhehe chabhe pakate jha akalongo bhabhe Akaichilahele, chehemo jhabhe ndi kubhehe akapiya matambiko bha Bhambo Chapanga ngita chabhalaghila.”<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Lende ndi lipungo lyabhe akapiya litambiko kuhumii kwa bhando bhibhapiya matambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, ibha ng'ombi amu limbelele, bhampela mpiya litambiko lukongono lwa nnonge, nyama jha muto na ibhende. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Namapela malobhoko gha mahuno ghino, divaye na mahuta ghino gha micheitune na mangoma gha mambelele ghukutumbu kuchekula. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Mu makabila ghino ghoha, Bhambo Chapanga alihagwii likabila lya Akalawe lintumikile ngita akapiya litambiko machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Anda Nnawe jhojhoha apala jwene ahotwi kubhoka pa muche gwogwoha ghola cha Ichilahele kujhenda kuntumikii Bhambo Chapanga kwenio chehemo jhapahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />ahoto kuntumika peniya ngita mpiya litambiko jwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino anda Akalawe bhange bhibhantumikii peniya nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Nabhapata mafungo ghabhe tela ngita akapiya matambiko bhange pamo nukubhehe bhipoke ilebhe kubhoke kwa akalongomundo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhenga ilebhe yaichimwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Pumpakuika pikilambo champakumpe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangajhigha jhe kuhenga ilebhe yangapala Chapanga, ghitendwa na bhando bhi kilambo chenio. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Pangabhe jhe na mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino, jwapakumpiya mwana mundo munalome amu mwikeghe kubhehe litambiko likukomelekeya, amu mundo jwalondola amu nnondola hilu nhwabhe, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />hilu mundo jwalogha hilu mundo jwa kimicha amu jwakuchuu mahoka amu kuchikii michuka. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Nhwalo mundo jhojhoha jwaitenda gheniya, ndi kilebhe chikuchimwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo jhi mihalo jhenie, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nabhabhenga bhando nnonge jhino bhibhatenda gheniya. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Nkoto kubhehe nililemo kukuhenga ilebhe yenio yu kuchimwa.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga ilaghana kunneta nnondole.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Mucha ngalonge kubhehe, “Bhando bhibhatama mu kilambo imijhenda kutola nambo bheniya bhilongochwa nukukengama uhabhe nu kulondola, nambo mangota Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ikana kutenda gheniya. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nahaghulila nnondole panakate jhino Akaichilahele jwabhii ngita nenga, na mangotamwe munnyokanikiya jwenie.”<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Chenie ndi chimunyopite Bhambo Chapanga gwino, kukitombe cha Holebo helahela kikemwa Chinae, lichiko linkonganika nu kulonge, ‘Twangajhoha jhe kabhele lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, hilu twangabhona jhe kabhele mwotu ghongo nkolongwa, tukaika kuwe jhe!’ <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Jwene Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, ‘Bhalongii lyambone. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Mbakunhaghulila nnondole panakate jha akalongo mundo ngita nenga, nanimmola nike chu kulongela, na jwenio nannobholela ghoha ghamba kunnaghalikiya. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Mundo jhojhoha jwangajhokanikiya malobhe ghapakulonge nnondole jwenio kwa ukindendeke gwango, ne namwete naninchwapula. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Nambo nnondole jhojhoha jhola jwapakujhigha kulonge lilobhe lyolyoha kwa ukindendeke gwango, kone nenga nongii jhe, nnondole jwenio apalwa kukomwa na nnondole jhojhoha jwapakulonge malobhe kwa ukindendeke gwa ichapanga henge, jwenio apalwa akomwa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nambo mangotamwe mihoto kulonge, ‘Natuhotolabhole kumanya lilobhe lyenio lihumii kwa Bhambo Chapanga?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Anda nnondole alongii kilebhe ku ukindendeke gwa Bhambo Chapanga na kilebhe chenio kipitii jhe, umanya kubhehe kilebhe chenie alongii jhe Bhambo Chapanga, nambo nnondole alongii kukindendeke chake jwene, namangotamwe manganyoghopa jhe.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Miche jhukutilila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Kibhalango 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 20:1-9">Kombokela 20:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Kipinde Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino papakwakomelekeya bhando bhala bha mu kilambo champela kibhehe chino, nu kutama munyumba yabhe na miche jhabhe, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />kwenio mihaghula miche mitato mu kilambo chenie chapakumpe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kibhehe chino. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Namaghana kilambo chenie champela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chehemo itato na kila chehemo jhimo nhaghula muche gwa kutilila. Peniya ntendekeya ndela jhipakwatenda bhando kuika kwenio kajhombe. Kupala mundo ankomite nnyake ahoto kutilila pakate jha miche jhenio abha njelembo. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mundo anda nkomite nnyake changanamii, najwenio akibha likoko jwake jhe, ahoto kutilila ku muche ghumo pakate jha miche jhenio, nu kughombola ughome gwake. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Tulonge, mundo ahoto kujhenda na nnyake kuliheghejha kutina hanjo, nikipinde chikupenguu luhanjo, libhagho likolike mumoko gwake, nu kunkoma nnyake, mundo jwenio ihoto kutilila pakate jha muche ghumo kughombola ughome gwake. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nambo anda muche gwenio ngaubhe ghumo tuu ghu kutilila na ubhii kutale hake, nnongo jwapakubhujhichila, ahoto kunkengama kwa lilaka likolongwa hake nu kumpukila mundo jwenio jwakomite, pamo akwete jhe luhadabulo lwa kunkoma jwakomite na bheniya bhabhele bhakibha jhe na bhulo pu kutumbula! <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Ndi nhwalo ninnaghalikiya mmaghaniche miche mitato.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Kabhele anda Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, anda ajhonjekii mipaka jha kilambo chino, ngita palaghina na akahoko bhino, nukumpelengana mangota kilambo choha chalaghila, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />peniya nahuaghula miche mitato jhenge. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino najhonjekeya mipaka jhino, nu kukamuu mihilo yenie jhoha jhanaghalikiya deleno na kumpala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kutama tela na mabholo ghake, <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />kupala bhando bhangamalemwa bhangakomwa jhe mu kilambo chino champe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kubhehe chino, nu kubhalangilwa mabhoha kubhehe malemwa ghu kukoma.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Nambo mundo anda abhii likoko jwa nnyake, anda annyobhile nu kunnyingilila nu kunkoma, peniya kutilila muche ghumo pakate jha miche jhenio, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />peniya ighogholo ya muche gwino bhituma bhando bhakammoye umuche gwenio ghu kutilila nu peniya mundo jwenio apela kulepechela kunhwalo ghu kukoma, na jwenio ahoto kunkoma. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Mangamone jhe kiya, nambo muibhilikiya ukokotoko gwa kukoma mundo jwangalemwa mu Ichilahele, kupala ntama njelembo.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipaka jha makacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Pumpakujhingii mu kilambo chenie champe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangahegheke jhe mipaka jha nnyino jhibhekwite na bhala bhibhatumbwile kuhumii makacho.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo kwa bhando bhibhalolite nu kujhoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Uchaile gwa mundo jhumo ukwela jhe kunhadabuu mundo nhwalo gwa lilemwa lyolyoha amu ubhoho ghoghoha gwateile. Nambo ipalwa ubhaha gwa bhando bhabhele amu bhatato tu ndi ghupalwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Anda nalongela uwange kupala kuntakalila mundo jhojhoha kunhwalo ghu lilemwa lyolyoha, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />bhahe, jwenio na mundo jwantakalile kunhwalo gwenio bhijhenda jhukunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga na nnonge jha mpiya litambiko na akakenga bhibhabhii kuhumii mu lihengo kipinde chenie. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Akakenga nabhalingukiya maha nhwalo gwenio na anda mundo jwalolite nu kujhoha nhwange na antakalile nnyake kuwange, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />peniya muntenda ngita chapata kuntendela nnongomundo. Yene ndi chimpakuibhilikiya ubhoho panakate jhino. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Bhando bhange pibhapakujhoha nu kujhoghopa, nu ubhoho ngita gwenio nautendeka jhe panakate jhino. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Mangabhone jhe kiya bhando ngita bheniya. Malepo ghake ghanga, Jwapakukoma najwenio hele akomwa na jwapakummoha liho nnyake na jwenio hele akolopolwa liho na jwapakung'onyola lukongono lwa nnyake na jwenio hele akolong'olwa lukongono.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Anda mijhenda kungondo kubulana na akamakoko bhino, anda miwene falache na mutuka ihutwa na falache na akakomana ngondo twe hake kuliku akakomana ngondo bhino, mangajhoghopa jhe. Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jwammohita ku Michile nabhaha pamonga na mangota. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Kabula jhukutumbu kubula ngondo, mpiya litambiko naika nnonge jha akakomana ngondo nu kulonge, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Makakomana ngondo bhuku Ichilahele jhokanikiya! Deleno mmandikii kubulana na akamakoko bhino. Mangahengeleka jhe mwojho amu kujhoghopa, amu kupwelela amu kwajhoghopa akamakoko bhino, <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ndi jwapakujhenda pamonga namangota kubulana ngondo na akamakoko bhino nu kuntenda mangota kwahotola.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Peniya, ilongoche ya akakomana ngondo nabhalobholela akakomana ngondo kubhehe, ‘Bho, abhii mundo jhojhoha pamba jwachengite nyumba nhyono nambo anabheka jhe palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga? Anda abhile abhujha kajhake, pange ihoto kujhomokela kungondo jhonge na kujhebhelecha lubhaho jhonge. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Bho, abhii mundo jhojhoha pamba jwapandite chabibo anahanganii jhe malobhoko gha uhohe gwake? Abhujha kajhake ihoto kujhomokela kungondo na mundo jhonge kuhanganila chabibo yake. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Bho, abhii munalome pamba jwabhoite inyaghabhole na abhandikii kutolela? Abhujha kajhake, ihoto kujhomokela kungondo, nu munalome jhonge kumujhila mwikeghe jwenio.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Ilongoche bha akakomana ngondo nabhajhendelela kukonya, ‘Bho, abhii mundo pamba jwahengelike mwojho? Abhujha kajhake kupala akoto kwatenda ajhake kuhengeleka mwojho ngita jwenio.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Ilongoche pibhapakujhomolela kulonge na akakomana ngondo, nabhahaghula akolo bha akakomana ngondo.”<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Kipinde pimibhandikii kujhingilila muche, makonya anda bhipala kabula ngondo amu. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Bhando bha muche gwenie bhapomwiye kabula jhu kubulana ngondo, bhahe, bhando bhubhabhii mwenio nabhabha akabhanda bhino nu kuhenga mahengo gha kwa chokolekeya. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nambo anda bhando bha muche gwenio bhammpomwiye kuuteke namangota, nambo ngabhabulana ngondo na mangota, bhahe, namuujhobhela muche gwenio, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chantenda muhotole muche gwenio na kwakoma akanalome bhoha. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Nambo akakeghe na yana yabhe na ng'ombi na yoha ibhii pabomane, mitola mateka ibha ino, mihoto kuhanganila ilebhe itoii ya akamakoko bhino, yenie ndi ilebhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ampile. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Yene ndi chimipala kwiitende miche jhoha jhibhii kutale na kilambo chimpakutola kubhehe chino.”<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Nambo mu miche jhibhii mu kilambo champe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kubhehe chino, mangaighaya jhe kilebhe chochoha kubhehe ghome. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Namakomelekeya njwenjwe bhando bhoha, Akahite na Akaamole na Akakaanane na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche ngita Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino channaghalikiye, <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />kupala bhakoto kummolangana kuhenga ilebhe yaichimwa ichapanga yabhe, namangota kuntende gwanganandela Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, yene makoma bhoha.”<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Anda mikilenganikii kuujhobhela muche kwa machiko nu kukomanila kupala kuupukila, nkoto kuhangabhana mikongo jha uhohe kulibhagho, mangapenguu jhe mikongo jha uhohe. Bho, mikongo ndi akamakoko ade mipengule? Mihoto kulye uhohe gwa mikongo jhenio nambo mangapengu jhe. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Mihoto tuu kupenguu mikongo jhenge na kutengenechela ngache jhukukwelela mapamanda gha muche, ade mahotole bhando bha muche gwenio.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo panane jha bhibhakoma bhando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“Mundo anda abhonikine akomitwe ku mighonga jha kilambo chenio Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ampile kibhehe chino, na mangota mmanyii jhe ghane jwankomite, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />ilongoche na akakenga bhino bhapitila nu kupema kulipa kuhumii pubhii ntuhe ade muche gwapahina. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Peniya, ilongoche bha muche gwenio gwa pahina na ntuhe bhitola litohe lya ng'ombi lyangatumbu kuhenga mahengo hilu kuntabha lingolengole. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Bheniya nabhahelela nako litohe lyenio kululambo luna kikemba changajhoma mache, nu lulambo lwenio lunalemwa jhe hilu kupanda, kwenio bhilitunyula ntandala litohe lyenie. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Akapiya matambiko bhilukolo lwa Akalawe bhipalwa bhabha pena. Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino akahagwii kupala bhantumikile na kunnyopa Bhambo Chapanga abhape mota bhando kwa liina lyake. Bheniya helahela bhakwete ukindendeke kwa kila nhwalo na mihalo jha makakala. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Litohe lyenie pilitunyulwa ntandala, ilongoche bhoha bha muche ghola chikibhii pahina na ntuhe gwenio, nabhakuwa mabhoko ghabhe kwa mache panane jha litohe, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />nu kulonge kubhehe, ‘Tunkomite jhe mundo jhonjo, hilu jwankomite tummanyii jhe. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, malekekeya bhando bhino bhuku Ichilahele mabhakombwile kuhumii ku Michile. Mangatulolekeya na mangatubhalangila jhe bhando bhino malemwa gha kukoma kwa mundo jwangamalemwa, nambo malekekeya malemwa gheniya.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Kukutenda yenio mibhe jhe nililemwa ku nhwalo gwa kuwe kwa mundo jwenio, nhwalo nteilingine ghapala Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akakeghe bhibhapukwilwe kungondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Makajhenda kubulana ngondo na akamakoko, na Bhambo Chapanga ampii kwahotola, na kwapukila bhando kwa makakala, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />anda mundo pakate jhino amwene mwikeghe jhuna kuhalala pakate jha bhando bhabhapukile, na mwe ntenda kumpala kutolana, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />bhahe, mwe manalome mipalwa kuntola kajhino, na jwenio na achekula muto gwake, aeketa yobho yake, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />nu kukijhanula ngobho yake yapukilwe nayo. Atama kipinde cha mwehe ghumo kwalele atatemundo na amajhemundo, peniya, mihoto kutolana nukubhehe nhwana gwino. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Pukajhomoke gheniya, anda mupahi jhe, minneka mahulo ajhabhule kokoha kwapala, manganchulucha jhe hilu mangantenda jhe ngita mmanda, kwa nhwalo munkoliche hone.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha uliche gwa mwana jhulitibho munalome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Anda abhii munalome abhii na matala na matala gheniya ghampapii yana inalome, nambo mwana jhukutumbu kubhelukwa chi jwa mwikeghe jwangampala, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />nambo lichiko lyapakuamula kwape yana yenie uliche, tate jwenio ipalwa jhe kuloleke kumiho, kukumpela mwana jwa mwikeghe jwampala kubhehe mwana jhulitibho nu kumpe ilebhe yamahele na kunneka mwana jwajho jhu mwikeghe jwangapalwa na jwenio ndi mwana jwa litibho. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Impala annyeketela mwana jhulitibho, ata ibhehe mwana jwa mwikeghe jwangampala, nu kumpe lipungo lyake lya uliche, kabhele mala pabhele mu ilebhe yake yapalwa kupata.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana jwangajhoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Anda mundo abhii na mwana jwangannyokanikiya tate mundo amu majhemundo ata ibhehe akatate pibhanchwapula nambo amela ijhoha ndeka, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />bhahe, majhemundo na tatemundo bhintola nu kuntakalila kwa ilongoche pa litangala lya muche gwenie. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Akatate bheniya bhalobholela ilongoche bha muche gwenie kubhehe, ‘Mwana gwito ajhoha jhe ni ukendembuka, apahii jhe kutujhokanikiya na kuhapa nu kulobhela.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Peniya, bhando bha muche gwenie nabhambula maghanga mwana jwenio ade aweghe. Pena ndi pimpakuibhilikiya ubhoho gwenio pakate jhino mangota. Kila mundo ku Ichilahele naujhoha nhwalo gwenio nu kujhoghopa.”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jhenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Anda mundo atehii lilemwa lilimpala akomwa na anda akomitwe akongelwa pankongo, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />ntuhe gwake mwangauleka jhe ujhunjela pankongo ade lukela, nambo munchika lichiko lele. Nhwalo mundo jwajhenjela pankongo abhii pahe jha likoto lya Chapanga. Mangakitenda jhe kilambo champii Bhambo Chapanga gwino kubhehe nilikoto.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Anda mumwene ng'ombi amu limbelele lya nnongo gwino Mwichilahele ahobhite, manganneka jhe, nambo mumujhicha kwa nnongo gwino. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nambo anda kajhake nnongo gwino kulipa amu mumanyii jhe nkola lyake, bhahe, mukipeleka kinyama chenie kajhino, kitama kajhino ade nkolo jwake papakupitila, namwe namumujhichila. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Ntende helenaha anda abhii liponda amu ngobho amu kilebhe chochoha mangakileka kinhobhalela cha nnongo gwino. Mangaleka jhe kuntangatila.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Anda miliwene liponda lya nnongo gwino amu ng'ombe jwake ligwelii pandela, mangaleka jhe kuntangatila, muntangatila nnongo gwino kunnyinula kinyama chenio.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Akakeghe bhingiwala jhe ngobho yakanalome, na akanalome bhingiwala jhe ngobho yakakeghe. Jwatenda yenie ndi kilebhe chakichimwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Anda mukolii uhue gwa kijhune munkongo amu pandela, kibhii na mapupo amu mahombe na nyongolo aghajhobhotii mahombe gheniya, mangampukii jhe nyongolo. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Munneka nyongolo ajhabhule, nambo mihoto kutola mapupo. Anda ntehi yene namma na mota nu kutama yaka twe.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Pimichenga nyumba, mmeka ubhegho kunane jhi kipaghalo, kupala mangakokolekelwa jhe anda mundo agwile nu kuwe kubhoke kwenio.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Makapanda jhe michabibo pamonga na ipandwa henge mughonda gwino, kukutenda naha uhohe gwa nchabibo gwino hilu uhoe ipandwa henge nhwalo nibhe jhe ino.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Mangantabha jhe lingolengole limo ng'ombi ni liponda pamonga, pimilema nng'onda.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Mangawala jhe ngobho jhilokitwe kwa mangoma gha limbelele pamonga na kitambala kinhuo.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Ntabha ihundo ya nyuche mu pandi yoha ncheche ya ngobho jhino.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo kunhwalo gwa munalome na nhwana gwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Anda munalome atolii mwikeghe nu kugholoka nako, peniya ipala kunneka, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />nu kulonge malobhe ghuwange kuntakalila mwikeghe jwenio, pange mwikeghe jwenio akibha aumanye munalome kabula jhukutolana.”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Bhahe, akatate bha mwikeghe jwenio bhatola uchaile gwa mwana gwabhe kulangii anagholoka jhe na munalome nu kupeleka uchaile gwenio kwa ilongoche bha muche na kwalangiya, kulonge kubhehe, <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />“Tatemundo nalongela kubhehe ‘Tukantolanikiche kamwale jwito kwa mundo ojho, nambo ngohe impala jhe kabhele. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Tuhechuka kukuntakalila kwa ilebhe ya hone nu kulonge kubhehe ankolii jhe nu uchaile gwa ghoha ghulangii kubhehe akibha aumanye munalome. Ata yene uchaile gwa kamwale gwito ulangiii kubhehe anakongana jhe na munalome ndi ghongo pamba.’ Peniya, akatate mundo nahatambula ngobho jhina uchaile gwenio nnonge jha ilongoche bha muche. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Peniya, ilongoche bha muche bhintola munalome jwenio nu kumbula yato. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Nabhahadabula mundo jwenio alepa ipande makome kome ya madine gha feza na kumpela tate jhumukeghe jwenio kwa nhwalo munalome jwenio ampii hone kamwale jwa Ichilahele. Nu mwikeghe jwenio ajhendelela kubhehe nhwanamundo na ihoto jhe kunneka mughome gwake ghoha.”<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Nambo anda matakalilo gheniya gha chakaka, na ubhii jhe uchaile ghulangii akibha aumanyii munalome kabula jhukutolana, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />bhimpeleka mwikeghe jwenio ku litangala lya nyumba jha tatemundo na akanalome bha kilambo chenie bhimbula maghanga ade aweghe, nhwalo ubhoho ku Ichilahele ku kutenda ngongola kunyumba jha tatemundo. Ndi chimpala kuibhilikiya ubhoho gwenio pakate jhino.”<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Anda munalome bhunhumbwi nu mwikeghe jwa mundo jhonge, bhoha bhabhele munalome na mwikeghe bhipalwa bhakomwa. Ndi nanhubhikiliya ubhoho gwenio pakate jhino.”<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Anda munalome agholwike na kamwale jwapokii kibane cha mundo kubomane, anda agholwike nako, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />mahutila panja jha muche bhoha bhabhele na kwabula maghanga ade kuwegha. Kamwale jwenio akomwa nhwalo achobhii jhe kanonoya kupala atangatilwa pamo nu kubhehe akibha pabomane, helahela munalome akomwa nhwalo agholwike na mwikeghe jwapokile kibane cha mundo jhonge, Yene ndi chimpa kuibhilikiya ubhoho gwenio pakate jhino mangota.”<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Nambo anda munalome akongine na kamwale kunng'onda panja jha pabomane jwapokii kibane cha munalome jhonge nu kunnimba, peniya munalome jwenio tu jwapakukomwa. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Manganhadabu jhe kamwale jwenio chochoha, nhwalo akwete jhe lilemwa lilimpala akomwa. Kilebhe chenie cha munalome, kibhaha tela na mundo jwannyingilii mundo jhonge nu kunkoma, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />nhwalo munalome jwenio akannimbite kamwale jwenio, pamo nukuchobhela kanonoya kujhopa kutangatilwa pakibha jhe na mundo jhu kuntangatila.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Anda munalome ikamulwa ku kunnimba kamwale, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />munalome jwenio nannepa tate jwa kamwale jwenio ipande makome nhwano ya madine gha feza, kwa nhwalo ankoliche hone. Munalome jwenio apalwa kuntola kamwale jwenio abhe nhwanamundo, kabhele apalwa jhe kunneka muughome gwake ghoha.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Munalome jhojhoha angagholoka jhe na mwikeghe jwa tatemundo, kukutenda yene nankolecha hone tatemundo.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Kubhekwa kutale na bhando bha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Munalome jhojhoha jwatendwite kubhehe mbende amu jwahekitwe chinalome chake ipalwa jhe kulombana na ngongano ya bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Helahela mwana jhojhoha jwa pakituto hilu kibheluko chake ade kibheluko cha kome, ipalwa abhekwa kutale na bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Mundo jhojhoha jwa likabila lya Mwalome amu Mmoabo, ibheluko yabhe yoha ade ikibheluko cha kome, ipalwa abhekwa kutale na bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Kwa nhwalo bhakatei kukana kumpe mangota chakulya na mache pamakibha undela kuhumii ku Michile, kabhele bhakampii mbijha Baalamo mwana jwa Beole kuhumii ku Peteole, kwenio ku Mechopotaniya, kupala ampela mangota likoto. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino akannyokanikii jhe Balaamo, Bhambo Chapanga ngaghalambwiya likoto lyenio kubhehe mota, kwa nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino atei kumpalangana. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Yene, mangatenda jhe malaghano gha uteeke hilu ukoche na bhando bheniya, kipinde choha cha ughome gwino.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Nambo, mangachimwa jhe Akaedomu, bheniya ndi akalongo bhino. Na mangachimwa jhe Akamichile, nhwalo mukatamite mu kilambo chabhe pamakibha akaghene. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Kibheluko cha utato cha Akaedomu na Akamichile bhijheketelwa kujhingi mu ngongano jha bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubheka kighono nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Anda nnyendengine kungondo nu kubheka kighono, kila mundo abha miho angatenda jhe kilebhe chochoha changajheketelwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Anda abhii jhumo pakate jhino jwangajheketelwa na Chapanga kwa nhwalo gwa kupita mbejho ya kilome mu maloto kilo, jwenio apita panja jhikighono, natama jhe pahina ni kighono. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Nambo iikite kimiye ajhogha mache, lyobha pulitipika ahoto kubhujha pikighono.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Ipalwa kubhehe na chehemo kutale ni kighono kukujhenda kucholo. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Muyombo ino nghegha kingongwa, lyenie ntumila kuhembe libhomba nu kuyelela mahe ghino. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Kighono chino kipalwa kibhaha nyahinyahi kwa nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, patyangii pikighono chino kupala ankombole na kwabheka akamakoko bhino mu kindendeke chino. Yene mangakileka jhe kilebhe chochoha changapalwa pakate jhino anda jhe nannekangana.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jhenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Mmanda anda abhutukii kajhino kupala munnonde, mangamujhicha jhe kwa munahota gwake. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Natama muche ghoghoha gwahagwii, nambo mangammone jhe.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Mwichilahele jhojhoha, munalome amu mwikeghe, ipalwa jhe abha nngongola chehemo jhu kunnyinamila Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Mbijha yoyoha ipatikine kwa itendwa ya ngongola yenie, mangapeleka jhe mu nyumba jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ata ibhe jhikulepe nachile, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga inchimwa mundo ngita jwenio, munalome amu mwikeghe.”<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Piminnyahikicha nnongo gwino Mwichilahele mbijha amu chakulya mangannobholela jhe na nyonjekeya, hilu kilebhe chochoha chibhajhaikana bhando kukulepa kwa nyonjekeya. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Mihoto kujhopa nyonjekeya piminnyahikicha nng'ene, nambo nnongo gwino Mwichilahele mangammeke jhe nyonjekeya. Anda ntei yenie, Chapanga gwino nampela mota mu mahengo gwino ghoha ghipakuhenga mu kilambo chinnyenda kutola kubhehe chino.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Pimibheka nachile kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mangabhehe jhe nikiyoto kulenganikiya, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nanng'amba, namwe namma nililemwa. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Nambo mikola jhe lilemwa anda nkotwike kubheka nachile kwa Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />nambo anda mmekite nachile kukupala kwino, mipalwa kulenganikiya kajhombe.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Anda nnyingii munng'onda gwa michabibo gwa nnyino nhotwi kulye chabibo tanejhino, nambo mangatola jhe chabibo yoyoha kubheka mu kichukilo chino. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Anda nnyingii mu nng'onda gwa nnyino gwa mapemba nhotwii kukwejhuu manjwanjwane nukuyoghe mulubhoko nu kumemena, nambo mangato jhe kikwakwa kuhuna mapemba ghake.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jhukulekana nu kutolana kabhele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Anda munalome antolii mwikeghe na peniya impala jhe jwenio nhwalo akibwene kilebhe mwikeghe changakipala. Bhahe, munalome jwenio nanyandikila baluwa jhukulekana nu kumpe, peniya, mwikeghe jwenio nabhujhichwa kajhake. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Peniya, mwikeghe jwenio anda atoline na munalome jhonge, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />na munalome jhuubhele na jwenio anchimwite na jwenio anyandikila baluwa jhukunneka, kumpe na kummenga pakajhake, pange munalome jwenio atei kujhomwoka, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />bhahe, munalome jhukutumbula, jwenio ipalwa jhe kabhele kummujhii kabhele mwikeghe jwenio kubhehe nhwanamundo, kunhwalo atei ghangajheketelwa na Bhambo Chapanga. Kukutenda yene ndi kilebhe changakipala Bhambo Chapanga. Mipalwa jhe kuhenga kilebhe ngita chenio mu kilambo champii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kibhehe chino”<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jhenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Munalome jwatolii mwikeghe enoeno, angajhenda jhe kungondo hilu angapelwa jhe lihengo lyolyoha lenge. Alekwa mahulo kwa kipinde cha chaka chimo, kupala atame kajhake kukihanga nu nhwana mundo.”<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Mundo jhojhoha anda annyaikiche nnyake kilebhe angatola jhe lwala amu njiwa jhu kuyaghila kubhe pone, kutenda yene, mpakuibha ndela jhake jhu kupata chakulya kunhwalo jha ughome gwabhe.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Anda mundo jhojhoha pakate jhino antoii kwa makakala Mwichilahele nu kuntenda mmanda amu kunchulucha kuubhanda, mundo jwenio ipalwa akomwa. Ndi chimpakuibhikiliya ubhoho pakate jhino.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Anda mundo akamwii na malohe payegha, mipalwa mma miho kukengama mihilo jha akapiya litambiko Akalawe ghibhannaghalikiye. Nkengama mihilo jhoha ngita chanaghalikiye Bhambo Chapanga kutenda. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Nkomboka Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chakantendii Miliamo pimikibha undela kuhumii ku Michile.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Anda munnyahikiche nnyino kilebhe chochoha, mangajhenda jhe kajhake kukamulila pone, <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />nambo mnnendela panja na munneka jwene annetela pone jhenio. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Anda nhwocho abhekite ngobho yake pone, mangatamanajho jhe kelo ndaa, <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />mmujhicha kila lichiko kimiye kupala kilo ahotola kukiyeka nu kunnombe mota. Kutenda yene ndi kilebhe chikinhanganicha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Mangamponja jhe kibalua nhwocho na jwapala kilebhe, abha Mwichilahele amu jhumo pakate jha akaghene bhibhatama mu kilambo chino. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Kila lichiko, lyobha nukutipika jhe, munnepa malepo ghake gha lichiko lyenie, nhwalo jwenio nhwocho na malepo gheniya ndi kihobholelo cha mwojho gwake, kupala angannele jhe Bhambo Chapanga, namwe kubhehe nililemwa.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Akatate bhangakomwa jhe kwa malemwa gha yana yabhe, hilu yana yangakomwa jhe kwa nhwalo jha malemwa gha akatate bhabhe. Kila mundo nakomwa kwa malemwa ghake jwene.”<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Mangamponja jhe mundo jhojhoha chela chapalwa kupata akaghene na akakebha. Hilu mangatola jhe ngobho jha nanhwela kubhehe pone. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Nkomboka kubhehe mangota makibha makabhanda kukilambo chuku Michile, na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ngankombwila kuhumii kwenio. Ndi nhwalo ninnaghalikiya kutenda gheniya.”<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Pimihuna mahuno ghino munng'onda nu kulibhilila manjwanjwane ghange mwenio, mangabhujha jhe kutola, nambo malekela akaghene na akakebha na akananhwela, kupala Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino ampela mota mu mahengo gwino ghoha. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Anda minyua uhohe gwa micheitune jhino, mangabhujhii jhe kunyua kabhele mandabhe ghake, malekela akaghene na akakebha na akananhwela. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Pimitongo chabibo, mangabhujhii jhe kutongola chabibo iighilike, yene, malekela akaghene na akakebha na akananhwela. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Nkomboka kubhehe mangota makibha akabhanda mu kilambo chuku Michile, ndi nhwalo nimpelangana mihilo jhenje.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Anda ubhii bhulo kate jha bhando bhabhele bhuku Ichilahele, nu kujhenda kutakalilana puudamo gwa mihalo, kwenio jhumo anda abhonikine jwangamalemwa, na jhonge jhuna malemwa, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />jhola jwalemwite, anda ahadabwile kubulwa yato, nnyomola mihalo nannobholela jwenio agholoke pahe mangukama nu kunnapu yato nnonge jhabhe tela na lilemwa lyake lyatehile. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Jhuna lilemwa achwapulwa yato makome ncheche nambo yangapetelecha jhe. Anda mpeteliche yato yenie nammuntenda abha na hone nnongo gwino.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Mangantabha jhe ng'ombi nnomo puntumii lihengo lyukupuluwa mbonje.”<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipalwa itendeka anda ajhomwike nnongo gwino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Anda akalongo bhabhele akanalome bhitama chehemo jhikiteno na jhumo pakate jhabhe anda ajhomwike changaleka mwana munalome, mwikeghe jwenio angatolana jhe na mundo jhonge panja jha lukolo lwenio. Ipalwa nnongo mundo ammujhila lipwela lyenio. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mwana jhulitibho munalome jwapakubhelukwa nabhalangilwa kubhehe mwana mundo, kupala liina lyake lyangahobhelela jhe kukilambo chuku Ichilahele. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Nambo anda nnongo jwenio jwawile ampahi jhe mwikeghe lipwela jwenio, bhahe, mwikeghe jwenio akijhendela nnonge jha ighogholo bhi kilambo nu kulonge, ‘Nhwacha jwa anganabhango jwawile ipala jhe kujhendekeya liina lya nhwachamundo jwawile ku Ichilahele, ikana kulenganikiya ghapalwa kutenda pakate jha bhando bha Ichilahele.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Peniya, ighogholo bhi kilambo bhinkema munalome jwenio kulonge nako. Anda najhendelela kukamulila malobhe ampahijhe kummujhila, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />mwikeghe jwenio nannyendela jwenio nnonge jha ighogholo bhi kilambo, nanhula lighubache lyake na kunhune mata kumiho na kunnobholela kubhehe, ‘Yene ndi chiipalwa kuntende mundo jwakana kumpeke nhwacha mundo ibheluko.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Na liina lya nyumba jhake ku Ichilahele ibhaha, ‘Nyumba jha mundo jwa hulitwe lighubache.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jhenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Akanalome bhabhele anda bhitenda kubulana na mwikeghe jwa jhumo pakate antangatii unganamundo kwa kukamula makengele gha jwabulana na unganamundo, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />mangammone jhe kiya mwikeghe jwenio, nambo mulueketa lubhoko lwa mwikeghe jwenio.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Mangabhe jhe niipemo ya aina ibhele yukupemela, chimo kitopahu na chenge kijhojhohu. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Hilu mangabhe jhe na aina ibhele yi ipemo yu kupemela, chimo kikolongwa na chenge kichokombe. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Ntumiya kipemo cha uchakaka, kupala ntame kwa machiko ndii mu kilambo champelangana Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Bhoha bhibhatenda ilebhe yenie yukolowa, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, abhachimwa bhando bheniya.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha kwakoma Akaamaleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Mikomboka itendwa ya Akaameleke yabhantendila pimikibha umwanja kuhumii ku Michile, <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Akaameleke bheniya bhakannyogwipe jhe Chapanga, yene ngabhannyingilila kukunyobhela kuhumii unyuma, kongo ntotokile na kwakoma bhala bhibhakwabhita kachoko kone bhatotokalile. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Yene, kipinde Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, papakuntenda njelembo kubhoke pukujhingililwa na akamakoko bhino bhoha bhibhantindikii mu kilambo champii kubhehe chino nu kutama mwenio, makoma pulutu Akaameleke bhoha, bhangakombokwa jhe pahe jha nnema.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Matambiko gha mahuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Mucha ghajhendilila kulonge kubhehe, “Pumpakujhingila mu kilambo champe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kubhehe chino nu kutama mwenio, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />malobhoko ghange gha mahuno ghimpakuhuna mu kilambo champe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mighegha mu kichukilo ade chehemo jhapahagwii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jhukujhinamila. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Majhendelela akapiya matambiko jwantumikila kipinde chenie nu kunnobholela kubhehe, ‘Deleno nonge hotuhotu nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango kubhehe nyingile mu kilambo chabhalapila akahoko bhito nabhapela.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Mpiya litambiko natola kichukilo chenie na kukibheka nnonge jha chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />peniya milongela malobhe ghanga nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ‘Tate gwango akibha Amwalamo atyangityangita okwe na okwe, kubhoke peniya, ngahelila kujhenda ku Michile kwenio ngabhila nng'ene. Jwenio na akalongo mundo bhakibha bhando bhandina tugha pibhakibha kwenio, nambo ngabhabhila bhando hoko na kilambo kikolongwa bhina makakala. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Akamichile ngibhitutende ukokotoko ngubhutung'aha nu kutughaghalila kuhenga mahengo manonopo ngita akabhanda. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Peniya, ngatunnelila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhito, Chapanga ngajhoha kulela kwito, na ngaghabhona mang'ahe ghito na mahengo manonopo na chitubhonilwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Bhahe, Chapanga ngatubhohita kwenio ku Michile kwa makakala ghake makolongwa, ngatehila nginyililo na ikangacho nu kutenda ilebhe iticho. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Ngatuleta pamba nu kutupe kilambo chenje chikibholile mbone kukulema nu kukukoleka ipugho. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Na ngohe ninnete Bhambo Chapanga malobhoko gha mahuno ghango ghighapandwa mu kilambo chenie ghambile.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">Peniya, mibheka kichukilo pahe, nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nu kunnyinamila.<verse eid="DEU 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Namwe na Akalawe pamonga na akaghene nanhuanganila ghambone ghoha gheniya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ghampii mwenga na akalongo bhino. Nabhene nabhahanganila pamonga na mwenga.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Kila chaka chu utato, kila mundo apiya chehemo jha kome pa mahuno ghake ghoha kwa nhwalo jha Akalawe na akaghene na akakebha na akananhwela, kupala bhapata chakulya choha chibhapala pibhabhehe mu kilambo chino. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Peniya, milongela nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino kubhehe, ‘Mbiite kajhango lipungo lya nyahinyahi, nganapila Akalawe na akaghene na akakebha na kananhwela, ngita chanaghilwa ndende. Nganite jhe nhwilo gwino hilu kulibhalila. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Nyakii jhe lipungo lya kome pinikibha ninnelila, kabhele mbapii ndeka panakibha nangajheketelwa nnonge jhino, mbiite jhe matambiko gheniya kwa bhibhawile. Nintembikii mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwango, na kutenda kila kilebhe chinnaghila. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Kubhoka pikitamo chino cha nyahinyahi kunane kwa Chapanga dola pahe, mape mota bhando bhino ku Ichilahele ni kilambo chimutupile ngita chamalapila akahoko bhito, kilambo chikibholii na chambone kulema nu kukoleka ipugho.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha abhapwatalila Bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Deleno, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, innaghalikiya mangota kuikamula mihilo na malaghakililo ghanga. Mma miho kulenganikiya kwa mwojho gwoha na uhuke gwoha. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Deleno nnyeketile Bhambo Chapanga, kubhehe Chapanga gwino nu kubhehe mikengama ndela yake nu kamuu malaghalikilo na mihilo jhake na malaghano ghake nu kunnyokanikiya jwenie. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Bhambo Chapanga jwene alongii deleno mangota anyeketile kubhehe ndi bhando bhake ngita chalaghila, nambo mipalwa nkamula mihilo jhake jhoha. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Nantenda mangota kubhehe kilambo kikolongwa nu kulumbililwa nu kupata ichima nu kumanyikana kuipeta ilambo yoha yapangine. Mangota namma bhando bhake Bhambo Chapanga jwenie ngita chalaghila.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha Chapanga jhijhandikwe mu maghanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Bhahe, Mucha pakibha pamonga na ilongoche yuku Ichilahele ngabhalobholila bhando naha, “Nkamula mihilo jhoha jhinimpelangana deleno. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Lichiko lyampakujhomboka lukemba Yoludane nu kujhingii mu kilambo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino champelangana, mijhemeka maghanga makolongwa nu ghukakilimila. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Panane jhake mijhandika mihilo jhoha, pumpakujhingila mu kilambo chikibholii na chambone kulema nu ukoleka ipugho Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahoko bhino, akalaghine nabho. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Pumpakubhehe kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane, mijhemeka maghanga ghanga panane jhi kitombe Ebale, ngita chininnaghalikiya deleno, nu kughakilimila kwa chokaa. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Namunchengela chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, chehemo jhenio kwa maghanga ghangabhachwa kwa kilebhe chochoha cha choma. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Ena, chehemo jhu kupiikiya litambiko jhimpakunchenge Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, uchengwa kwa maghanga ghangabhachwa. Panane jha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko jhenio mpiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino litambiko lyukomelekeya. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Mpiikiya litambiko lya uteeke, nu kulye papa na kuhanganila nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Panane jha maghanga ghinkilime nnyandika kukuuma mihilo jhenie,”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Bhahe, Mucha pamonga na akapiya matambiko Akalawe ngabhalobholila bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele kubhehe, “Ntame nuu, unyokanikiya ne, deleno mangota mmii mabhando bhake Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Kwa yene, mipalwa kulijhoha lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kukengama mihilo jhake na malaghalikilo ghannaghalikiya deleno.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likoto kwa bhangajhoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Lichiko lyenie Mucha ghabhalobholila bhando kulonge, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Andanyomolii kujhomboka lukemba Yoludane, makabila ghanga naghajhema panane jha kitombe cha Gelizimo kwajhope mota bhando, likabila lya Chimeone na lya Lawe na lya Yuda na lya Ichakale na lya Uchupo na lya Benjamine. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Na makabila ghanga naghejhema panane jha kitombe Ebale, kipinde chukubheka likoto, likabila lya Lubene na lya Gade na lya Achele na lya Chabulone na lya Dane na lya Nafutale. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Akalawe bhatangachila bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele kanonowa malobhe ghanga.<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwapakutendekeya inyagho yukubhacha andajhe yukuyana ni kujhinamila kinyemela, kilebhe chenie chikitendekiwe kwa mabhoko gha punde ndi chachimwa Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, amina!<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwanpucha tatemundo amu majhemundo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, amina!<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwatupuu ighinge ya mipaka ya nnyake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, amina!<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwantenda jwangalola kuhobha ndela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwanponja chapalwa apelwa nng'ene amu nkebha amu nanhwela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“Jhuna likoto munalome jwagholoka nunhwana jwa tate mundo, nhwalo, ankoliche hone tate mundo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />Jhuna likoto munalome jhojhoha jwagholoka ni kinyama chochoha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />Jhuna likoto munalome jhojhoha jwagholoka nu nnombomundo amu mwana jhukonkela jwa tate mundo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, Mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />Jhuna likoto munalome jhojhoha jwagholoka na nkohanomundo mwikeghe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, Mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />Jhuna likoto munalome jhojhoha jwakoma mundo kwa kiyepela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, Mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />Jhuna likoto munalome jhojhoha jwapoke chwinda kupala ankome mundo jwangalemwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, Mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />Jhuna likoto mundo jhojhoha jwangajheketela malobhe ghanga gha mihilo jha Chapanga nu mabholo ghake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">Na bhando bhoha bhijheketela, Mwika!<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Mota kwa bhibhajhokanikiya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">Akalabhe 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Kombokela 7:12-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Mucha ngajhendilila kwalobholela Akaichilahele, “Anda namunnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kuikamuu mihilo jhenio jhinninaghalikiya deleno, jwenio nantenda mme makolongwa hake kupeta ilambo yoha pannema. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Anda namunyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mota henge yoha nahibha ino.”<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Bhambo Chapanga, champela mota ku miche jhino na mighonda jhino.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Bhambo Chapanga champela mota kukumpe yana hoko na mahuno ghamahele na helahela ng'ombi na mambelele.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Bhambo Chapanga champela mota kukumota mahuno ghamahele gha chakulya.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Bhambo Chapanga champela mota kwa kila kilebhe chimitenda.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Akamakoko bhino anda bhiika kunnyingilila, Bhambo Chapanga nanpelangana makakala ghakwahotola. Anda bhaikite kunnyingilila kwa ndela jhimo, nabhapechengana kwa ndela chaba.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />Bhambo Chapanga champela mota mu mahengo ghino nu kutweleya ikoko ino mahuno. Champela mota mu kilambo champelangana kubhehe chino.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Bhambo Chapanga chantenda mme bhando bhake jwenio ngita chalaghila, anda nanyokanikiya mihilo jhake jwenio Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kukengama ndela jhake. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Bhando bhi ilambo yoha pannema nabhaumanya kubhehe mangota mwe nhaghulilwe kubhehe bhando bha Bhambo Chapanga jwenie, nabhannyoghopa. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Bhambo Chapanga nantenda mme na yana twe na ipugho na mahuno mu mighonda, mu kilambo chalaghana na akahoko bhino kubhehe chabhapela. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Bhambo Chapanga nannyogholila kihukilo chake chikibhii kunane nu kunkomela ula mu ilambo ino kukipinde chikipalwa, nu kumpe mota mu mahengo ghino. Namuijhaikicha ilambo twe, nambo mangota mijhahika jhe. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nantenda kubhehe muto na chi nkela jhe, namma bhukutumbula na chi bhukujhomolela jhe. Mijhendelela nnonge na chi kubhujha unyuma anda mwikamuu mihilo jhake jhinimpelangana deleno na mma miho kulenganikiya yenie. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Nambo mangaleka ng'o mihilo jhango nu mangaijhinamii jhe ichapanga henge nu kuitumikila.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghighapa kunkolela changannyokanikiya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">Akalabhe 26:14-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Nambo anda kunyokanikiya jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino amu kulenganikiya jhe maha mihilo jhake jhoha na malaghalikilo ghuninalaghalikiya deleno, bhahe, ilebhe henge yoha yanganandela nainkolela.”<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nampela likoto mu miche jhino na helahela mu mighonda jhino.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Bhambo Chapanga naipela likoto mahuno ghino na chakulya chino.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Bhambo Chapanga nampela likoto mipapa jhe yana hoko na mahuno ghandina na ng'ombi yandina na mambelele ghandina.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Bhambo Chapanga nampela likoto mu kila kilebhe chimihenga.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />Anda ntei ubhoho na kunkana Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, naninetela mang'ahiko na kupoghanika na kuhangabhana mahengo ghino ghoha nu kunkoma kajhombe. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Nang'elekana malwalo kila kipinde ade mabhoha nhwengane mu kilambo chenie chinnyenda kutola kubhehe chino. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Bhambo Chapanga nambula kwa malwalo ghu kujhambukiya na malwalo ghanganandela na mapute na lulanga lwangapeta na kimbonga na ngongobhe, ilebhe yenie nainkengama ade inkomelekeye. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Ula naikoma jhe na nnema naubhaha ngita choma. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Bhambo Chapanga naleta kimbonga cha lutukunda na kimbonga cha mihyanga, nakimpulalila ade nanhwa.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Bhambo Chapanga nantenda malepelele akamakoko bhino. Mangota nannyenda kwajhingilila kwa ndela jhimo, nambo nantilangana kwa ndela chaba. Bhando bhoha pibhapakulola ghighampatite nabhanchimwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Pumpa kuwegha, mituhe jhino naibhaha chakulya cha ijhune ni inyama, napitii jhe mundo jwapakwahaka. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Bhambo Chapanga nambulangana kwa mapute ngita chatehila kwa bhando bhuku Michile, yegha jhino jhinijhela iongapute na ilonda yenie kulama jhe, nambo kutughuta kwanga kotoka nantela nhwenako. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Bhambo Chapanga nantenda mme magholoka, helahela nantenda mangalola na ulwalo ghukupoghanikwa. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Nantyanga kukupapaya papaya muhe anda mangalola hilu mipata jhe kilebhe mu mahengo ghino. Kila kipinde nannponjwa, napitii ng'o mundo jwakuntangatila.”<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Miloa mwikeghe, nambo natolana jhonge mundo. Anda nchengite nyumba, bhando bhange nabhagholoka. Anda mipanda michabibo, bhando bhange bhiuna. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombi ino naichinjwa kongo mabhene kupeta kulola nambo mipaha jhe hilu kiboma chimo cha nyama jhenie. Maponda ghino ghitolwa kwa makakala kongo mipeta kulola hilu nammujhichilwa jhe. Mambelele ghino nabhapelwa akamakoko bhino na abhii jhe mundo jhukuhoto kuntangatila. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Yana ino inalome ni ikeghe naitolwa na bhando bhange kuipeleka kuubhanda kongo makapeta kulola nduu. Kila lichiko milenda pange naibhujha ade miho ghino ghikojhoka, nambo kibhii jhe chimpa kutenda. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Bhando bhi kilambo chenge nabhatola mahuno ghino ghunnemite gha kilambo chino namangota mipata jhe kilebhe chochoha, nambo kubhonelwa nu kulaghichwa machiko ghoha, <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />nu kulagha kwino nakuntenda mme makatama ngholoka. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Bhambo Chapanga nanchwapula mapute mu majhugwa ghino gheniya mihoto jhe kulama, ghijhenela kuhumii kulototohi ade kulwajho.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />Bhambo Chapanga nampeleka mangota na akanahota akakolongwa bhino jhumpa kukihaghulila ade kukilambo changakimanya mangota hilu akahokobhino. Na kwenio namtumikila ichapanga jhenge jha mikongo na maghanga. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Namangota mibha kilebhe changapalwa, kabhele kilebhe chukupuchwa na kukutende chanake kwa ilambo yoha, kwenio kwapa kumpeleka Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Mipanda mbejho twe nambo mahuno ghandina tu kwa nhwalo madidima ghilya mahuno ghino. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Mipanda michabibo nu kuitunja maha, nambo kibhii jhe chimihuna, na hilu kunywe divaye jhake, nhwalo ikokolo ipakulye. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Nankola micheitune kila chehemo mu kilambo chino, nambo mikola jhe mahuta gha micheitune, nhwalo micheitune yenie ipakupolota. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Nampapa yana inalome ni ikeghe, nambo namuihobhecha nhwalo naitolwa kwa makakala na akamakoko kuhwalo gwa ngondo. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Mikongo jha uhohe ghoha na mahuno ghino ghoha, niilegwa na madidima.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Akaghene bhibhatama mu kilambo chino nabhajhonjekeka nukubhehe namakakala, nambo mangota mwe mujhendelela kupwetekelela hake. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Akaghene nabhannyahikicha mangota, nambo mangota mikola jhe uhotolo gwakwajhahikicha. Bheniya bhibha mitwe nambo mangota mibha mikela.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Ilebhe ibhoho yenie yoha naimpatanagana nu kunkengama mangota ade inkomelekeye nhwalo munnyokanikii jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kuikamuu mihilo jhake jhampiikiye. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Nambo gheniya naghanangiya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga. Ayomii mangota na ibheluko ino yoha, machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, ngampila mota mu kila kilebhe, nambo mangotamwe ngamutumikila kwa mwojho puupele. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Yene namatumikila akamakoko bhapakwaleta kwino Bhambo Chapanga bhambule. Namma na njala na nyota na makengele nu kupelulwa kila kilebhe. Akamakoko bhino nabhanhengecha mahengo majhundupahu ade nhweghe. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Bhambo Chapanga naleta kuhumii kutale bhando akakale na mangota mukimanyii jhe kilonge chabhe, nabhannyingila kajhombe ngita matumbuhe. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Kilambo chenie china bhando akakale bhanga kiya na bhina lukenja kumiho lyajhoghopa jhe ighogholo amu lyabhone jhe kiya achikangombo, <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />nalilya ipugho ino na ipandwa ino, na mangota nang'ahika kwa njala ade nhweghe. Kinneke jhe kilebhe chochoha hilu divaye hilu mahuta gha micheitune amu ng'ombi amu mambelele ade pumpa kuwegha. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Bhando bheniya nabhantindikiya kupala kunhibhilila mu ilambo ino yoha, ade mapamanda ghino matandamaho ghimihobholila, naghatiluka, kila chehemo pikilambo chenio champii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Kipinde akamakoko chibhapakutindikiya miche jhino, nammabha na njala hake, ade nampala kulye yana ino, yana yampii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Ata mundo jwatokomii hake nambo hele jhuna malango hake, nabhajhakila akalongo mundo na aanamundo jwapaile na mwana jwabhe jwapakuighala. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Hilu nammaghulila jhe ata jhumo pakate jhabhe, nyama jha yana yake yapakulya. Miighiya jhe kilebhe chochoha kipinde chenie chukuntindikiya nu kumbulwa na akamakoko mu ilambo yoha. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ata mwikeghe jwatokomii hake kuliku bhoha, na jhuna malango hake na jhuna ilebhe mbwe, jwangalebhata lwajho lwake pahe na jwabhii lembulembu hake, natenda helahela nanyakila unganamundo jwampahile na mwanamundo munalome na mwikeghe, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />kipinde chenie chukuntindikilwa nakubhaha na njala hake, ailya pikiyepela mwana mundo kilemba na ngobhekela yake. Imaghulii jhe unganamundo jwampahile amu mwana mundo jhumo jwa yana mundo kumanya.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Anda nukubhehe miho jhe kujhokanikiya mihilo jhenje jhijhandikwe mu kitabo chenje na changaliichimu nu kulilomba liina likolongwa na lyakujhoghowa lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga nannetela mangota malagho makolongwa na gha kughujhoghowa pamonga niibheluko ino. Helahela nannetela kubhabhula na indondo yangapeta na malwalo ghighakoma. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Bhambo Chapanga nannetela kabhele malwalo makolongwa ghala ghinnyogwipa ku Michile, gheniya naghankolela mangota namilama ndeka. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Nannetela malwalo gha kila namuna na ghange malagho ghajhandikwe jhe mu kitabo chenje cha malaghalikilo ade ghannyomwole. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Pamo nukubhehe mangota mmi twe ngita ndondo yu kunane kwa Chapanga, nambo nanhighalila mandina tu kwa nhwalo mukannyokanikii jhe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Ngita hela Bhambo Chapanga chahalalii ilebhe inyendela telatela nu kuntenda kubhehe mme twe, nambo jhojho Bhambo Chapanga chahanganii kunnete malwalo ghukunkomangana. Namangota namputwa mu kilambo chenie channyenda kutama ngita chino.”<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Bhambo Chapanga, nantenda mpechengane pakate jha bhando bhi ilambo yoha, kuhumii upande ghumo gwa nnema ade ghonge na kwenio nantumikila ichapanga itengenichwe kwa maghanga na mikongo, ichapanga yenie mangotamwe hilu akahoko bhino bhimanyii jhe. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Mitama jhe njelembo hilu chehemo jhino pu kupomolela mu ilambo yenie. Nambo Bhambo Chapanga nampela iholo umwojho nu kulo maha jhe nu kukenyangenya umwojho. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Machiko ghoha nantama kukujhoghopa. Muhe na kilo bhando nabhabha na kiholo, kabhele naumanye jhe kubhehe kilabho nanyimuka njelembo. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Miojho jhino nidundadunda kwa kiholo kwa kila kilebhe chimpakukibhona. Lukela milonge, mbaha ngaibhii kimiye, pikiika kimiye milonge, mbaha ngaibhe lukela. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Bhambo Chapanga, namujhicha kabhele ku Michile kwa mele, kwenio akalaghii kukulonge impeleka kabhe jhe kwenio. Kwenio mijhigha kukichulucha kwa akamakoko bhino kubhehe akabhanda, nambo abhii jhe mundo jwapakunhemela.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga na Akaichilahele mu kilambo chuku Moabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Ghanga ndi malobhe gha lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga lyanaghila Mucha kulibheka na Akaichilahele mu kilambo chuku Moabu, pamonga na lilaghano lela lyatehila nabho Akaichilahele kukitombe chuku Holebo.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Mucha ngabhakemita Akaichilahele bhoha na kwalobholela, “Mabhene nnolite Bhambo Chapanga chantendii munahota nkolongwa Falao, jwaku Michile na ilongoche bhake bhoha kwenio ku Michile. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Mabhene makalolite ilebhe ikolongwa na ikangacho na nginyililo yatehila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Nambo ade deleno Bhambo Chapanga ampeki jhe malango ghukumanya, na miho ghukulola hilu machikilo ghukujhokanikiya ghala ghimipetile. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa yaka makome ncheche, Bhambo Chapanga nikannongwiche ku njenga ngobho ino ikatundungii jhe ihwalita hilu maghubache ghino mu makongono hele ikatukutwike jhe. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Makabhehe jhe na mabumunda ku nhwalo gwa chakulya makabhehe jhe na divaye kunhwalo ghukunywe. Nambo Bhambo Chapanga akantangatile.” <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Mangota kipinde chinhikita chehemo jhenje, Sihone, munahota nkolongwa jwaku Heshbone na Ogu, munahota nkolongwa jwaku Bashane, ngabhakomina namangota, nambo tukahotwile, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />ngatutohila kilambo chabhe, ngatwaghabhila makabila gha Leubene na Gade na nuchu jha likabila lya Manache, kibhehe kilambo chabhe. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Yene mma miho kughakamulii malobhe ghoha gha lilaghano lende kupala mma na mota kwa kila mahengo ghimihenga.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Deleno, mangota mwe nnyemite nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, mmii niilongoche na akanahota bhino na ighogholo na akatumiche bhino, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />yana ino na akaanabhino na akaghene bhibhatina hanjo nu kunteke mache bhibhatama pakate jhino. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Mmii pamba deleno kupala kubheka lilaghano lende lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino lyabheka na mangota deleno, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />kubhehe ilangii mangota ndi bhando bhake na jwenie nabhaha Chapanga gwino, ngita hela chalaghina mangota na akahoko bhino Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Lilaghano lende na mihilo jhake na ilapo yake nihenga jhe na mangota kanjika, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />nambo nihenga na mangota munnyemite pamba nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga na ibhelukwa ito yangabheluka.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Mabhene umanye kubhehe chitutamita kukilambo chuku Michile na chitutyangita pakate jha ilambo ya bhando bhange ade ngatuikita pamba. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mukaiwene inyagho yabhe yukuchimwa ibhaijhinamila yene ndi ichapanga yabhe yukubhacha kwa mikongo na maghanga na madine gha feza na chaabo. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mukilolekeye kubhehe abhii jhe munalome amu mwikeghe amu nnongogwino amu mundo jwa likabila lyolyoha lilijhema pamba deleno lilipakumpucha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito nu kujhenda kuitumikii ichapanga ya ilambo henge. Kilebhe chenie nakibhaha ngita lukegha lulumelite nu kupambika uhohe ghunangaghae ghighabhi na uchongo. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakujhoha malobhe gha lilaghano lende jwalapichwe, nu kukilongelela jwene kumwojho gwake nukulonge nabhaha njelembo, ata aghalambuka unyuma nu kujhendelela nilighoho lyake, kilebhe chenie nakinkomelekeya pulutu mambone na manganandela. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Bhambo Chapanga nannekekeya jhe mundo jwenio, ni lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga na lupemelo lwake nalujhaka kwa mundo jwenio, likoto lyoha lilijhandikwe mu kitabo chenje nalimpata jwenio, na Bhambo Chapanga nannyomola pulutu mundo jwenio. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Bhambo Chapanga nammeka puupele kuhumii pakate jha makabila ghoha ghaku Ichilahele, kupala ghampate mang'ahe kulengana na likoto lyoha, ngita chijhandikwe mu kitabo chenje cha malaghano.”<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Ku ibheluko ipakuika, ibheluko ino na akaghene kuhumii ku kilambo chukutale nabhalola mang'ahe Bhambo Chapanga chakiletile kilambo chenje mang'ahe na malagho. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Kilambo chino choha nakihangabhanwa kukutwelee maghanga gha balute na mwinyo, kibhijhe kilebhe chochoha chikipakumela hilu manyahe naghamela jhe. Kilambo chino nakibhaha ngita pikibha kipinde Bhambo Chapanga paikomilikiya Chodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimo, ku lilaka lyake ngalya. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Ena, bhando bhilambo yoha bhilonge, kilebhe ghane Bhambo Chapanga akitehi yene kilambo chenjeno? Kilebhe ghane lilaka lya Chapanga lichochite naha? <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Bhando nabhajhangula naha, ndi nhwalo bhando bha Chapanga bhalipuchite lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa akahokobhabhe, kipinde chabhabhohita mu kilambo chuku Michile, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />ngabhajhenda kuitumikii na kuijhinamila ichapanga henge, jhangaimanya makacho, ibhakanakilwa kuijhinamila na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Yene lilaka lya Bhambo Chapanga ngilijhaka panane jha bhando bha kilambo chenie, kukuleta mang'ahe nu kukilete likoto lyoha jhijhandikwe mu kitabo chenje. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Chenie ndi chikintendita Bhambo Chapanga, abhabhohe kukilambo chabhe. Ngabhayomila hake na ngabhataghila ku kilambo chenge ngita chibhii deleno.<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Ilebhe ya lupwepo ndi ya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, nambo ghala ghayekwile ndi ghito na ibheluko ito machiko ghoha ghangapeta, kupala tughakengama malobhe ghoha gha malaghalikilo ghanga.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Bhambo Chapanga abhapela mota bhando bhake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Mucha ngajhendilila kulonge, “Nimpekii nhwaghulana mabhene mota amu jhe likoto. Nkomboka mambu ghanga chehemo jhojhoha pipakubhehe pakate jha ilambo ipakupelekwa na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />anda mumujhii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino mangota na yana ino, nu kulitembekeya lilobhe lyake kwa mwojho gwino na uhuke gwino ghoha nu kukengama malaghalikilo ghinninaghalikiya deleno, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />peniya, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nankolela kiya na kummujhicha kuhumii mu kilambo champeingine na kumpela ghambone. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Na ata mpechangane kutale hake pannema, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nankonganicha nu kummujhicha, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />kupala mwitola kabhele kilambo chibhatamita akahoko bhino. Jwene chantenda mme na mota hake nu kubhelekana hake kupeta akahoko bhino. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino chantenda mangota na ibheluko ino mme na mwojho gwa utembekelo kupala mukung'ana jhojho kwa uhuke gwino ghoha, kupala ntame mu kilambo chenie. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nabhabhujhichila likoto lende lyapate akamakoko bhino bhibhanchimwa nu kung'aha. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Mangota mulitembekeya lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga nu kukamuu mihilo jhake inimpekeya deleno. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nantenda mme na mota mu kila lihengo limuhenga, nampapa yana hoko na ng'ombi twe na mighonda jhino naipiya mahuno twe. Nhwalo napala kabhele ngita chabhapalita akahoko bhino, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />anda namuntembekeya nu kamuu mihilo na malaghalikilo ghake ghighajhandikwe mu kitabo nu kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kwa mwojho ghoha nu uhuke ghoha.”<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Mihilo jhinnimpeke deleno inonwipe jhe kwino, na mihoto ku itenda. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Ibhii jhe kunane kwa Chapanga ade nnonge, meneke nakwela kunane kwenio kutuletela, kupala tuhoto kujhoha nu kuikamula? <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Hilu ibhii jhe kwiye jha baale ade kulonge, “Meneke jwapakujhomboka kwiye atuletele kupala tuijhoha nu kuikamula? <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Nahi jhe, nambo ibhii pahina namangota, ibhii munnomo gwino nu umwojho gwino, kupala militembekeya.”<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Deleno, nimpelengana nhwaghule pakate jha ghambone na mabhoho, kate jha ghome anda jhe kuwegha. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Anda mitembekii mihilo jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino jhinnimpekeya deleno, nu kumpala Bhambo Chapanga gwino, nu kukengama ndela jhake nu kamuu malaghalikilo na mihilo jhake, bhahe, mpakulama nu kubhehe twe na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nampela mota mu kilambo chenie chimijhenda kutama. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Nambo anda nhwobhite nu kukana kuntembekeya, nu kuutilwa kuijhinamii ichapanga jhenge nu kuitumikila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />deleno ne nintangachila kubhehe chantenda kuwegha. Milama jhe kwa machiko ghamahele mu kilambo chimijhenda kutama kubhehe chino, kwiye jhu lukemba Yoludane. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Niijhopa kunane na nnema ibhaha akachaide kwino kwa chela chimpa kuhaghula, nhwalo deleno jhene nimpelangana kuhaghula pakate jha ghome nu kuwegha, na kate jha mota nu likoto. Bhahe, mbaha nhwaghule ughome mangota ni ibheluko ino kupala nname, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />mupale Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nu kuntembekeya nu kulombana nako. Nhwalo kutenda yene kulangii nankola ughome hoko ghukutama kukilambo chabhalapila akahoko bhino Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Yochuwa itola chehemo jha Mucha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Kibhalango 27:12-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Mucha ngajhendilila kulonge na Akaichilahele bhoha, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />ngabhalobholila kubhehe, “Nenga ngohe mmi na yaka miya jhimo na makome mabhele, nihoto jhe kunnongoya nhwalo makakala ghanyomokile. Na kabhele Bhambo Chapanga anobholile kubhehe nijhomboka jhe lukemba lwa Yoludane. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Bhambo Chapanga gwino, nanongolela nnonge jhino na kwajhomola bhando bhi ilambo bhibhatama mwenio, kupala ilambo yenie ibha ino. Na Yochuwa nabhaha kilongoche gwino. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Bhambo Chapanga nabhajhomola pulutu bhando bhibhatama mu kilambo chenio ngita chibhajhomwila Sihone na Ogu, akanahota akakolongwa bha Akaamole pamonga nikilambo chabhe. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Bhambo Chapanga nantenda mahotole bheniya na mangota namatenda ngita chinninaghalikiye. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mma nganganga hilu mangajhoghopa jhe nu kwalendema bheniya, nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nabhaha pamonga na mangota. Jwenie nanneka jhe kuntangatila nu kwakomboka.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Peniya Mucha ngankema Yochuwa na kunnobholela nnonge jha bhando bhuku Ichilahele kubhehe, “Mma nganganga na jwangajhoghopa nhwalo mwenga ndi namalongocha bhando bhamba kujhenda kutama mu kilambo Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila kwape akahokobhabhe na mwenga mipalwa kwaghabhila ngita ubhujhilo gwabhe. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ndi nannongocha, jwenie ndi nabhaha pamonga na mangota na akotoka jhe kuntangatila anneka jhe kunkomboka. Yene mangajhoghopa jhe hilu kuhechuka.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo ichomwa kila chaka cha chaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Bhahe, Mucha ngajhandika mihilo jhenio nakwapela ilongoche bhoha bhuku Ichilahele pamonga na akapiya matambiko bhu lukolo lwa Akalawe, bheniya ndi bhibhapalitwa kughegha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhalaghila kubhehe, “Kila mwicho gwa chaka cha chaba ndi chaka chu kulekekeya maghambo. Machomela gheniya kanonoya pu unyagho gwa ichimba. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Machomela gheniya bhando bhuku Ichilahele kipinde chibhaika kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga gwino chehemo jhukujhinamila. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Makema bhando bhoha, akanalome na akakeghe pamonga na yana na akaghene bhibhatama mu ilambo ino kupala kila mundo ajhoha mihilo jhenie na akibhola kunyinamila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino nu kughakamula mabholo ghake kukuhobholeka. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kukutenda yene, ibheluko ino yangaimanya mihilo jhenje jha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nabhajhoha. Kupala bhakibhole kunyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino machiko ghoha ghibhapa kutama mu kilambo chimibhandikila kutama nu kubhehe chino, kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe gha mwicho gha Chapanga kwa Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Machiko ghino ghukujhomwoka ghabhandikile, munkeme Yochuwa nhwikengane mu Lihema lya Nyahinyahi mbala nimpele malaghalikilo.” Bhahe, Mucha na Yochuwa ngabhajhenda mu Lihema lya Nyahinyahi, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapitila mu luheke lwa lihunde lulujhemite pannyango ghu Lihema lya Nyahinyahi.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha kubhehe, “Ngohe mmandikile kujhomwoka, nu kubhoke pukujhomwoka, bhando bhapakutumbuu kuijhinamii ichapanga henge mukilambo chibhajhenda kutama. Bheniya nabhanneka nenga nukuhangabhana lilaghano lyamekite pamonga na bheniya. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Anda bhatei gheniya mbakubhehe nililaka ku nhwalo gwabhe, mbakwaleka na kwakoma. Ilebhe yanganandela na malagho naghanyingilila, peniya, nabhamanya kubhehe ilebhe yene yapitii nhwalo ne Chapanga gwabhe mmii jhe pamonga na bheniya. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Chakaka ne nangotoka kuntangatila nhwalo bhateilingine ilebhe yanganandela nu kuijhinamila ichapanga henge.”<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Ngohe, nnyandika nhwambo ghongo, mabhole bhando bhuku Ichilahele kupala ghalangiya bhinamalemwa kunhwalo bhinyokanikiya jhe nenga. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Pimbakumpeleka mu kilambo chikibholii kulema nu kukoleka, ngita chanalaghila akahokobhino, nabheniya ngabhalila nu kujhukuta nu kukenda, ngabhaighalambukila ichapanga henge nu kuitumikila, bhambakumbucha nu kulitwekuu lilaghano lyango. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Pighapakumpata malwalo ndiii nu kulagha, nhwambo ghongo ubhaha gwa kwakombocha kubhehe nnemwite panakate jhabhe na panakate jha ibheluko yabhe. Na ade ngohe nukumpeleka jhe mu kilambo chinalapila mbakwape, manye ilebhe yabhawachila.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Peniya, Mucha ngajhandika nhwambo gwenio lichiko lele, na ngabhabhola aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannaghila Yochuwa mwana gwa Nune kubhehe, “Nkwime na mangajhoghopa jhe, nhwalo mpakwalongocha Akaichilahele mu kilambo chanapila mbakwape, nenga nama pamonga na mwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Mucha pajhomolila kujhandika malobhe gha mihilo jhoha mu kitabo pukutumbula ade pukujhomolela, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />ngabhalobholila Akalawe, bhibhakibha ni lihengo lyukughegha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Ntolangane kitabo chenje cha mihilo, mikibheka pahina na Lichanduko lya Lilaghano lya Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, kupala bhahoto kumanya pibhalemwa. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Manye chimmii makakokotoko na mina ngandango nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga mmi naghome pamonga na mangota, nabhabhaha akakokotoko hake pambakuwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Makonganiche nnonge jhango ilongoche bhoha bha makabila ghino na akanahota bhino bha akakomana ngondo, kupala nonge malobhe ghanga bhaghajhohe, kongo kunane kwa Chapanga na nnema ijhoha. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Nhwalo ne manye kuhumii pukujhomwoka kwango, chakaka mpakubhehe manganandela nu kuileka ndela jhininnaghalikiya mikengame. Na machiko ghukupehekeya naghankolela mang'ahe, ku nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga mutehi achimwe nhwalo gwa itendwa ino yanganandela.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwambo gwa Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Peniya, Mucha ngachomita malobhe ghu nhwambo gwenio nnonge jha aka Ichilahele bhoha.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Jhokanikiya mwe ma kunane kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">Nnyokanikiya mwe mannema, malobhe ghinilongela kwamilomo jhango.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mabholo ghango ghakoma ngita hula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">na malobhe ghango ghatola ngita mangame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ngita umelemele mu ipandwa ichokoichoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">ngita hula nyebhejhalo mu mahamba mabhehe.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Nhwalo nandangacha liina lya Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">na kila mundo amanya Chapanga gwito ndi Nkolongwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Bhambo Chapanga ndi lindalabho lya njelembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">mahengo ghake ndi gha chakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">nautenda ilebhe iipalwa tugha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Tuhoto kunhobholela na twenga tukanhobholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Jwenio atenda ilebhe yambone nu yu kuhobholeka.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Nambo mangotamwe mpelwii kuhobholeka kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">kunhwalo gwa malemwa ghino, mijhendele jhe yanamundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">mangotamwe mung'alambwike nu kutenda malemwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Mangota mabhando bhumpumbumwike na manga malango, mboni mnepa gheniya Bhambo Chapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Jwenio chi Tategwino jhe jwampangine nukutenda mme ni makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">kutenda mabhando bhina makakala.<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Nhwachila akahokobhina chibhatamita makacho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">makakonye akatate bhino, bhanchimulila ghighapitii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">makakonye ilongoche bhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">nabheniya nabhanchimulila.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Chapanga Nkolongwa ngabhapila bhando ilambo kubhehe uliche gwabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">pabhaghina bhando bhoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">ngabheka mipaka mu kila kilambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">tela naichabo jha bhando bhuku Ichilahele,<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />nambo Chapanga ngahagwila bhana bha Yakobu kubhehe bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">bheniya ngakihaghulila bhabhehe bhake.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Pabhakolila pi kilambo china njenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">njenga jhanga mikongo, china upepo nkale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">Ngabhalonda na kwatunja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">ngita chalonda lio lyake.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Ngita litumbuhe chilibhola yanamundo kuhomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">nu kuhatambula mapapanilo nu kughegha mapupo ghake kwa mapapanilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">kupala ghangalegwa jhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Bhambo Chapanga ndi chabhalonda aka Ichilahele kupala bhangagwe jhe.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalongwiya bhando bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">na apahi jhe kubhehe na kichapanga chenge kintangatile.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Ngabhatenda bhapete pi kilambo chu kunane chiitombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na bheniya ngabhalila ilebhe yu mu mighonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Ngabhapila bhuche ghu mu linkwembe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">na mahuta gha micheitune ghighalemwite mundope gwa kihekendo kinonopo.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Ngabhapila siage na mabhele ghi ipugho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">bhakibha na mambelele ghina kukenda na mbuhe na ng'ombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">ngabhapila ngano jhambone hake na divaye jhambone kuhumii mu michabibo jhabhe.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Nambo bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngibhakenda nu kunenepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">ngabhajhukuta, ngabhabhila niitambe nu kukenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">peniya, ngabhanneka Chapanga jwabhapangine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">ngabhannibhilila jwabhii Nkolongwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Ngabhantenda Chapanga akole wiho hake ku ichapanga yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">na ngabhantenda Chapanga achimwe, kuitendwa yabhe yanganandela.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Ngabhiipikiya matambiko ghu kukomelekeya kwa ichapanga, yangamanyikana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">ichapanga ihyono yangamanyikana na akahokobhabhe, ichapanga yanga jhinamilwa na Akaichilahele,<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />ngibhinibhilila Lindalabho lilimpangine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">ngabhanibhilila Chapanga jwabhapapita.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />Bhambo Chapanga ngakibhona kilebhe chenio, ngabhachimwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">ngabhaikana yana yabhe inalome ni ikeghe.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Bhambo ngalongila, ‘Mbakuleka kwatangatila kupala nnola chikipa kwakolela!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Nhwalo angota ndi bhando bhina milomo na bhangahobholeka.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Bhandei me nawiho kunhwalo gwa kuitumiki ichapanga yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">bhandei njimwe ku nhwalo gwa ichapanga yabhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Ku yene naleka bhalole wiho kwa bhala bhangabhe bhando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">nanatenda bhachimwe kunhwalo gwa kwatangatila bhando mambyeta.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Lilaka lyango lijhaka ngita mwotu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">nalitiniya ade pahe kukilambo cha bhando bhibhawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">lipakutiniya nnema na yoha ibhii mwenio,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">lipakutiniya michinge jha itombe.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Nanundika mabhoho ghamahele hake kwabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">na mbakwakoma kwa mahonga ghango.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Nabhakombala kwa njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">nabhajhomoka ku malwalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">nambeleka inyama ikale kwajhingilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na majhoka ghina uchongo bhalume.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ngondo najhatenda bhawe panja jha miche jhabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">kiholo chachakoma unyumba jhabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">na yana inalome ni ikeghe naikomwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">yana yabhe ijhonga na ighogholo yabhe, nihwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Nikalongi, nganakomelekii pulutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">kupala bhando bhangakomboka jhe pannema.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Nambo naleka jhe akamakoko bhabhe bhikiluye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">kukulonge bhahotwii bhando bhango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">kongo ne Bhambo Chapanga ndi nakomalikiye pulutu.<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Ichilahele ndi bhando bhanga malango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">bhando bhake, bhakwete jhe malango nkate jhabhe.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Ngabhakola malango ngabhamanye kilebhe ghane chibhalepelila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">kabhele ngabhamanye mwicho gwabhe naubhabhole.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Bho, mundo jhumo nahotolabho kwabula bhando elufo jhimo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Amu jhe bhando bhabhele nabhahotola bhole, bhando elufo kome?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Iwechekana tugha pange Bhambo Chapanga atei kwaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">na pange tu Bhambo Chapanga jwabhe bhatei kwaleka.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Ata akamakoko bhabhe bhamanye kubhehe kichapanga chabhe kikwete jhe makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">ngita chabhii na makakala Chapanga jwa aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Nhwalo michabibo jha akamakoko bhabhe ibhokite ku maina gha Chodoma na mu mighonda yuku Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">chabibo yake ina uchongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">na ikonywa yake ina kubhabha.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Divaye yabhe ngita uchongo gwa lijhoka. uchongo gwake ngita majhoka.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, ‘Bho nakalitunjite jhe nhwalo ghongo nukulibheka mu kihukilo chango?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">Nendela kipinde chikipalwa nahadabule.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Kulepechela ndi kwango nenga, namwete nanepechela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">kipinde makongono ghabhe pighapakugwegha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">nhwalo lichiko lyabhe likujhomwoka liikite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">kupehekela kwabhe kubhandikile hake.<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Bhambo Chapanga nabhakengelela bhando bhake nu kwabhone kiya akatumiche bhake, kipinde papakubhona makakala ghabhe ghajhomwike hilu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">abhii jhe jwahighilike, mpungwa amu jwanga pungwa.’<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Bhambo Chapanga papakwakonya bhando bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">‘Ibhii ko ichapanga ino jhenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">lindalabho limilibhutukila mme njelembo?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Ibhii ko ichapanga ilila matambiko ghino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">nu kunywe divaye na matambiko ghino gha ghukunywe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Bhahe, ijhinuke na jhintangatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">miileke jhenie ibhe kinga jhino ngohe!’<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />‘Dola ne ndi Chapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">na hilu abhii jhe jhonge nambo nga nenga tugha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Ne ukoma nu kuyokicha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">ukochula nu kulamiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">abhii jhe jwahoto kunkombola jhojhoha kubhoka kwa nenga.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Nhwalo nitondobhe lubhoko lwango kunane kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">nu kulapii kubhehe ne ndi jwanitama machiko ghoha ghangapeta,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />nannola upanga gwango ghung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nu kutundobheya lubhoko lwango kwahadabula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nabhalepechela mabhoho akamakoko bhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nu kwahadabula bhibhanjimwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Chanakoma akamakoko bhango ku upanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">upanga gwango nuukoma bhoha bhibhanjimwa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">nanneka jhe hilu jhumo jwapakukomana na nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">na bhando bhibhakochokine na bhapungwa nabhakomwa.’<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Ilambo ihanganila pamonga na bhando bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">nhwalo jwenio apakulepechela myahe jha akatumiche bhake kwa bhoha bhakomite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kulepechela kwa akamakoko bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">nu kukijhelebhula kilambo uhakaho gwa bhando bhake.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Mucha na Yochuwa mwana jwa Nune ngabhaika nnonge kujhemba nhwambo gwenio, kupala Akaichilahele bhoha bhujhohe.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha ijhomolela malobhe ghake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Mucha pajhomolila kwalobholela bhando bhuku Ichilahele malobhe ghanga ghoha, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />ngabhalobholila, “Maghabheka kumwojho gwino na kughajhokanikiya malobhe ghoha ghininnobholile deleno. Mipalwa kwiibhola yana ino kupala ikengame kukuhobholeka malobhe ghoha gha malaghalikilo ghanga. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Nhwalo malaghalikilo ghanga chi malobhe jhika tu jhe nambo ndi ughome gwino, kwa kukengama malaghalikilo ghanga nantama machiko ghamahele mu kilambo channyenda kutola kubhehe chino, kwiye jha lukemba Yoludane.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Lichiko lele, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Nkwele pi kitombe cha Abalimo, ade pi kitombe cha Nebo mu kilambo chuku Moabo, kujhenda ku kilambo chuku Yeliko, makalole kilambo chuku Kaanane, chanape Akaichilahele kubhehe chabhe. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Peniya, nannyomokela koko kwenio kukitombe nukuchikwa koko ngita chajhomwika nhwachagwino Alune, pajhomwika ku kitombe cha Hole, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />kwa nhwalo gwenio mabhoha mabhele makande kunemwa nnonge jha Akaichilahele, pamakibha mu mache ghuku Meliba, pahina na kilambo chuku Kadeche, ku njenga jha Sine, ngamaleka kulangii kubhehe minyokanikiya jhe pakate jha bhando bhango Akaichilahele. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Bhahe, namukibhona tugha kilambo chenio chukutale, nambo milebhata ndeka mu kilambo chenie chanape Akaichilahele.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Mucha aghape mota makabila ghuku Ichilahele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Henge ndi mota, Mucha mundo jwa Chapanga, jhabhajhopila Akaichilahele kabula jhu kujhomwoka. Ngalongila kubhehe,<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ngahika kuhumii kukitombe chuku Chinae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ngatupitila kuhumii kukitombe chuku Cheile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">ngatulangalila kuhumii kukitombe chuku Palane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Ngapitii panakate jha maelufo gha akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">na mwotu ghujhaka mu lubhoko lwake lwalelo.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapala bhando bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">na kwalonda bhando bhake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">Akatumiche bhake bhu kunane kwa Chapanga kutama pahina na jwenie nukujhokanikiya mabholo ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">nu kupata malaghalikilo kubhoka kwabhe.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Mucha ngatulaghila kukamuu mihilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">chenio ndi kilebhe chamaha hake chukututangatila mu kilambo chito.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhe munahota nkolongwa jhuku Ichilahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">kipinde ilongoche yabhe pibhakonganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">na makabila ghoha pighakonganika.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Mucha ngalongila kunhwalo gwa likabila lya Leubene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Leubene alama hilu angajhomwoka jhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">na bhando bhake bhangakepa jhe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Yuda ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga nnyokanikiya ng'uto ya likabila lya Yuda yukupalwa kutangatilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">mmujhiche kabhele kwa bhando bhange.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Nkomanile kwa mabhoko ghino mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga nu ubhatangatile kwahoto makoko bhabhe.<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Lawe, Mucha ngalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">nnangiye ghala ghimipala gwino kupeta Ulimo na Thumimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">kupete akatumiche bhino aka Lawe bhina kunhobholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">bhimajhighita kwenio ku Macha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Makawene kubhehe bhina uchakaka hake ku mache gha ku Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Akalawe ngabhaleka nyumba yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">kupala bhantumikila mbone mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">na bhakalijhokanikii lilobhe lino</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">na ngabhalikamulila hake lilaghano lino.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Likabila la Akalawe bhaibhola ibheluko ya Yakobu mihilo jhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">bhaabhola bhando bhuku Ichilahele mihilo jhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">nabhapiya matambiko ghoha ghu kukomelekelwa pa chehemo jha kupiikiya matambiko ghino.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, milipe mota likabila lyabhe libhaha na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">maghajheketele mahengo gha mabhoko ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">maghataghila kutale makakala gha akamakoko bhabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">bhibhanchimwa bhakoto kujhinuka kabhele.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Benjamine ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Lende ndi likabila lyalipalita Bhambo Chapanga na kulilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">jwenio ulilonda muhe jhoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">na helehela utama pakate jhabhe.<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Uchupo ngalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Bhambo Chapanga akipela mota kilambo chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">kwa ula kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">na chembwe ya mache kuhumii pahe jha nnema,<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />bhakapelwa mahuno ghambone ghighajhela kipinde cha lyobha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">na bhakapate mahuno mbwe gha kila mwehe,<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />mahuno ghambone gha itombe ya makacho, ipiya mahuno ghambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">na mahuno ndii gha itombe ya makacho.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Kilambo chake kitwelela ghoha ghighabhii ghambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ulumbililwe kwa umbone gwa Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">gwalongile kuhumila mukiheghejha chikijhaka mwotu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Uteeke ghongo gwaulukila bhando bha likabila lya Uchupo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">nhwalo akibha kilongoche jwa akalongo mundo.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Uchupo abhii na makakala ngita likambako lya ng'ombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">manyelo ghake ndi gha lijhate lya nkambako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Efulahimo nabhaha na manyelo elufo kome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">manyelo gheniya ndi, Manache nabhaha na akakomana ngondo elufo kome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">na Efulaimo nabhaha na akakomana ngondo elufo kome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">nabhatumila akakomana ngondo bheniya kwabulalii bhando bha ilambo henge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">ade mupehekelo gwa nnema.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Chabulone na likabila lya Ichakale ngalongila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Likabila lya Chabulone libhaha na mota kwa mahengo ghabhe ghu umbwane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">na helehela likabila lya Ichakale libhaha na mota kwa mahengo ghabhe gha mu mahema ghabhe.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Namalalika akaghene mu itombe yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">na kwenio nabhapiya matambiko ghighapalwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Mana bheniya kichumo chabhe kuhumii umbwane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">nu ihukilo ihiitwe muupele jha ncheke gwa mbwane.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Gade, ngalonge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Alombwa Chapanga jwampii Gade chehemo ngolongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gade uyema ngita liimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">jwanyopoto lubhoko lwa kinyama na palototohe lwa muto.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Ngakihaghulila chehemo jhambone jhibholii kupeta poha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">chehemo jhihaghulilwe kunhwalo gwa kilongoche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Ngabhalongwicha bhando na kunnyokanikiya Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">ngatimicha lihengo lya Chapanga kwa aka Ichilahele.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Dane ngalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">Dane ndi litohe lya liimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">jwahomba kubhoka ku Bashane.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Kunhwalo jwa likabila lya Nafutale ngalonge naha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Mwe ma Nafutale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Bhambo Chapanga ampii mota kukumpala hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">kilambo chino nakihika upande ghu kuchine mwa lilabha lya Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kunhwalo jha likabila lya Achele ngalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Achele abha namota kuipeta yana yoha ya Yakobu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">na akalongo bhake nabhampala hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">na kilambo chake nakibhaha na mahuta ndii gha micheitune.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Matangala gha miche ino naibhaha jha choma na shaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">Ughome gwino ghoha ntama njelembo!”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Mucha ngajhomolila kukulonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">“Mangota mabhando bhuku Ichilahele, abhii jhe jwabhii ngita Chapanga gwino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">jwenie ubhoka kunane kuika kunntangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">jwenie upeta kunane kumahunde kongo ung'alicho gwake, ukabhonekana.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Chapanga jwangapeta machiko ghoha ghangapeta ndi chehemo jhino jhikubhutukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">makakala ghake ghabhonekana pannema machiko ghoha ghangapeta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Ngabhabhutwiya akamakoko nnonge jhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">ngalaghila, ‘Makomelekeya bhoha.’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Kuyene, bhando bhuku Ichilahele ngabhatamita njelembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mu kilambo chikitwelii yakulya na divaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">kilambo chenio ula ukoma kuhumii kunane kumahunde.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Mmii na mota mangota aka Ichilahele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Ghane jwabhii ngita mangota?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Bhando bhikombolilwe na Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">jwenio ndi ngao jhino na jwantangatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nu upanga ghunnete kuhotola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Akamakoko bhino nabhaika kunnyopa mabhone kiya nnonge jhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">na mangota namalimbilikiya pahe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Kujhomwoka kwa Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhoka pandika jha Moabu, ngajhenda kukitombe chiku Nebo, ngakwela kukilegheleghe cha Pisiga mwiye na mwiye jha Yeliko. Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga nganangiya kilambo choha, kubhoke ku Gileade ade ku Dane. <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Chehemo jhoha jha Nafutale na chehemo jha Efulaimo na pa Manache, na chehemo jhoha jhuku Yuda ade kumbwane jha ku Meditelaniya, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />chehemo jha Negebo pamonga na chehemo jha njenga jha Yeliko pikondita muche gwa mitende ade ku Sohale. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Chenje ndi kilambo chanapila Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu kubhehe, naniipela ibheluko yabhe. Ninnangiye tugha nambo naninneka jhe nnyingila.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Yene, Mucha ntumiche jwa Bhambo Chapanga ngajhomwika kwenio kukilambo chuku Moabu ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalongila. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Bhambo Chapanga nganchika kuling'engo lyuku Moabu mwiye jha kilambo chuku Bete Peole, nambo ade ngohe abhii jhe mundo jwalimanye likabule lyake. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Mucha akibha na yaka miya jhimo na makome mabhele pajhomwika na miho ghake ghakibha ghanakojhokana jhe na akibha na malango ghambone na makalala. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Akaichilahele ngabhalelita malelo kwa machiko makome matato, pandika jha kilambo chuku Moabu. Peniya, machiko ghukugholoka matanga pighajhomwikila.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Yochuwa mwana gwa Nune ngatweliwa uhuke gwa malango, nhwalo Mucha akammekii mabhoko ghake, yene Akaichilahele ngabhannyokanikiya Yochuwa nu kuikamuu mihilo ngita chibhannyokanikiya Mucha tela na Bhambo Chapanga palaghila.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Ade ngohe anapitii jhe nnondole jwa Bhambo Chapanga ku Ichilahele ngita Mucha na jwalongila nako Bhambo Chapanga ngita mundo chalonge nanyake. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Abhii jhe nnondole jhonge jwahotwii kulangiya nginyililo na ikangacho, ngita Mucha yatumitwa na Bhambo Chapanga atende kwa akanahota akakolongwa bhuku Michile na akatumiche bha kilambo chake choha. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Abhii jhe nnondole jhonge jwahotwii kuhenga ilebhe ikolongwa yukujhoghowa ngita yatehila Mucha nnonge jha Akaichilahele bhoha.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>